Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224922%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20women%20smiling%20and%20posing%20for%20the%20camera.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f30a8ce52cb26b8391a3d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223691%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ECharlotte%20Lim%20started%20training%20at%20the%20gym%20regularly%20after%20her%20daughter%20convinced%20her%20to.%3Cp%3EAmanda%20Goh%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20wasn't%20until%20her%20daughter%2C%20Yan%2C%2043%2C%20asked%20her%20to%20join%20the%20gym%20that%20she%20co-owns%20with%20her%20brother%20in%20Singapore%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ethat%20Lim%20finally%20started%20seeing%20results.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWithin%20a%20year%2C%20I%20could%20do%20an%20unassisted%20sit-up%2C%26quot%3B%20Lim%20said.%20%26quot%3BWithin%20four%20years%2C%20I%20could%20do%20a%20chin-up.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20Yan%2C%20it%20was%20important%20that%20her%20mother%20started%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnot-retiring-work-healthy-aging-walking-splits-community-diet-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworking%20out%20with%20purpose%3C%2Fa%3E.%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3EMore%20than%20a%20decade%20ago%2C%20Yan's%20father%20died%20unexpectedly%20at%2069%20from%20an%20aortic%20dissection.%20Since%20then%2C%20she's%20made%20it%20a%20priority%20to%20help%20her%20mother%20stay%20healthy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20really%20was%20a%20wake-up%20call%2C%26quot%3B%20Yan%2C%20a%20fitness%20trainer%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BThe%20gym%20is%20to%20keep%20my%20mom%20not%20just%20alive%2C%20but%20healthy%20with%20no%20chronic%20illnesses.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHer%20brother%2C%20Tiat%20Lim%2C%20also%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flongevity-exercises-to-do-20s-30s-40s-trainer-tips-2025-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efitness%20trainer%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20he%20was%20fully%20on%20board%20with%20the%20idea%20of%20their%20mother%20joining%20from%20the%20start.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BNever%20in%20my%20wildest%20dreams%20did%20I%20expect%20her%20to%20be%20doing%20pullups%2C%20let%20alone%20weighted%20ones%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d03eb8d4-ff05-4b4e-b110-877cc3572549%5C%22%3EStarting%20from%20scratch%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EResearch%20suggests%20people%20can%20continue%20building%20muscle%20and%20strength%20well%20into%20older%20age.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.humankinetics.com%2Fview%2Fjournals%2Fijsnem%2F34%2F1%2Farticle-p11.xml%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2023%20study%3C%2Fa%3E%20found%20that%20adults%20over%2085%20benefited%20from%20strength%20training%20as%20much%20as%20those%20aged%2065%20to%2075.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20is%20never%20too%20late%20to%20start%20strength%20training%2C%26quot%3B%20Dr.%20Chia%20Jia%20Qian%2C%20a%20geriatrician%20at%20Tan%20Tock%20Seng%20Hospital%20in%20Singapore%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EChia%20said%20many%20older%20adults%20mistakenly%20think%20strength%20training%20is%20only%20for%20younger%20people%20or%20aspiring%20bodybuilders.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMuscle%20mass%20and%20strength%20decline%20in%20tandem%20as%20we%20age%2C%20and%20those%20with%20poor%20muscle%20health%20are%20at%20higher%20risk%20of%20falls%2C%20fractures%2C%20decline%20in%20physical%20and%20cognitive%20function%2C%20subsequent%20disability%2C%20and%20poor%20quality%20of%20life%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20she%20recommends%20beginners%20start%20with%20exercises%20that%20match%20their%20fitness%20level%20before%20gradually%20increasing%20the%20intensity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20fact%2C%20maintaining%20regular%20activity%20often%20helps%20reduce%20chronic%20joint%20pains%20and%20will%20improve%20function%20over%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22562%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20doing%20push-ups.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f4ea154f987526177786f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22316%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELim%20says%20her%20earliest%20workouts%20at%20the%20gym%20were%20brutal.%3Cp%3EAmanda%20Goh%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELim's%20first%20few%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-trainer-shares-20-minute-workout-for-building-muscle-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworkouts%20at%20the%20gym%3C%2Fa%3E%20were%20tough.%20She%20still%20remembers%20one%20of%20her%20earliest%20sessions%2C%20when%20100%20jumping%20jacks%20left%20her%20feeling%20like%20she%20had%20%26quot%3Balmost%20died%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20octogenarian%20joked.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYan%20still%20remembers%20her%20mother's%20second%20day%20at%20the%20gym%2C%20when%20the%20workout%20called%20for%20210%20reps%20of%20prison%20burpees.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20remember%20halfway%2C%20about%2045%20minutes%2C%20she%20looked%20at%20me%20and%20said%2C%20'I'm%20never%20giving%20up%2C'%26quot%3B%20Yan%20said%2C%20recalling%20her%20mother's%20words.%20%26quot%3BThat's%20my%20mom's%20principle.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToday%2C%20Lim%20is%20still%20the%20oldest%20member%20at%20the%20family's%20gym%2C%20where%20most%20clients%20are%20in%20their%2040s%20to%2060s.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20leaving%20its%20commercial%20space%20two%20years%20ago%2C%20the%20gym%20now%20operates%20out%20of%20the%20living%20room%20of%20the%20family's%20three-bedroom%20condo%2C%20where%20they%20all%20live%20together.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMembership%20costs%20259%20Singapore%20dollars%20a%20month%2C%20or%20about%20%24200%2C%20for%20unlimited%20classes.%20A%20virtual%20program%20is%20priced%20at%20S%2450%20a%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226240%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20women%20showing%20me%20around%20the%20home%20gym.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f2d42548c9c486b30e503%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224160%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20gym%20operates%20out%20of%20the%20family's%20living%20room.%3Cp%3EAmanda%20Goh%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELim%20attends%20three%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-quit-workout-classes-lifts-weights-instead-better-results-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eworkout%20classes%3C%2Fa%3E%20a%20week%2C%20with%20each%20session%20targeting%20a%20different%20muscle%20group%2C%20plus%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffull-body-workout-30-minutes-less-no-equipment-gym-trainer-2023-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efull-body%20workout%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20Saturdays.%20On%20days%20she's%20not%20at%20the%20gym%2C%20she%20runs%20and%20does%20bodyweight%20exercises.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20gym%20keeps%20a%20running%20leaderboard%20tracking%20every%20member's%20performance%20based%20on%20metrics%20such%20as%20workout%20times%20and%20weight%20lifted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMore%20often%20than%20not%2C%20Lim's%20name%20is%20one%20of%20the%20first%20the%20younger%20members%20look%20for.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224954%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20leaderboard.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f325a54f98752617777f9%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223716%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELim%20said%20younger%20members%20often%20check%20the%20leaderboard%20to%20see%20how%20her%20scores%20compare%20with%20theirs.%3Cp%3EAmanda%20Goh%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThey%20see%20it%20and%20say%2C%20'What's%20Aunty%20C%20carrying%20today%3F%20I%20must%20do%20the%20same%2C'%26quot%3B%20Lim%20said%20with%20a%20laugh.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2258b68979-9cae-41ce-b0ff-98bbf9baefc9%5C%22%3EBeyond%20the%20workouts%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EHealthy%20aging%20has%20become%20something%20of%20a%20family%20pursuit.%20Beyond%20exercising%20regularly%2C%20Lim%20and%20her%20two%20children%20undergo%20routine%20health%20screenings%20and%20monitor%20a%20range%20of%20biomarkers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20test%20results%20are%20a%20way%20to%20check%20whether%20the%20family's%20habits%20are%20paying%20off.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20mom%20has%20a%20clean%20bill%20of%20health%2C%26quot%3B%20Yan%20said.%20%26quot%3BNo%20issues%20with%20cholesterol%2C%20no%20high%20blood%20pressure.%26quot%3B%20Lim%20also%20doesn't%20have%20osteoporosis%20or%20sarcopenia%2C%20the%20age-related%20loss%20of%20muscle%20mass%2C%20which%20are%20common%20among%20older%20women%2C%20she%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225118%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mother%20and%20daughter%20doing%20a%20weighted%20squat.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5f31aa548c9c486b30e519%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223838%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EFor%20Lim%20and%20her%20two%20children%2C%20healthy%20aging%20has%20become%20a%20family%20pursuit%2C%3Cp%3EAmanda%20Goh%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ETheir%20approach%20to%20healthy%20aging%20also%20includes%20paying%20attention%20to%20nutrition%2C%20sleep%2C%20and%20social%20connection.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20means%20eating%20mostly%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flongevity-diet-simple-swaps-to-live-longer-and-save-money-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehome-cooked%20meals%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20sticking%20to%20an%20early%20bedtime%20of%209.30%20p.m.%2C%20and%20having%20strong%20social%20relations%2C%20Lim%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20family%20even%20has%20an%20acronym%20for%20the%20way%20they%20eat%3A%20No%20SOAP%2C%20which%20stands%20for%20sugar%2C%20oil%2C%20additives%2C%20and%20processed%20foods.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOut%20of%2021%20meals%20in%20a%20week%20%E2%80%94%20assuming%20we%20have%20breakfast%2C%20lunch%2C%20dinner%2C%20seven%20days%20a%20week%20%E2%80%94%20we%20eat%2019