s%20future.%20The%20campaign%20will%20run%20for%20100%20weeks%2C%20organizing%20various%20de-addiction%20activities.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TNN%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A100%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22NTA%20floats%20tender%20to%20secure%20offices%2C%20exam%20material%2024x7%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785714835000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132815843%2Cimgsize-1202908.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Findia%2Fnta-floats-tender-to-secure-offices-exam-material-24x7%2Farticleshow%2F132815810.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22MANASH%20PRATIM%20GOHAIN%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20bought%20a%20one-way%20ticket%20to%20Shanghai%2C%20thinking%20I'd%20stay%20for%20a%20year.%2012%20years%20later%2C%20it%20feels%20like%20home.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226229%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Graeme%20Kennedy%20filming%20in%20Dongbei%2C%20China%20for%20the%20SaintCavish%20channel.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c134287737bff3ebd9c46%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224672%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGraeme%20Kennedy%20knew%20he%20didn't%20want%20to%20stay%20in%20Canada%20but%20never%20expected%20to%20spend%20the%20next%20decade%20in%20China.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Graeme%20Kennedy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EGraeme%20Kennedy%20left%20a%20small%20town%20in%20Canada%20for%20Shanghai%2C%20expecting%20to%20stay%20one%20year.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20quit%20marketing%2C%20built%20a%20photography%20business%2C%20and%20now%20documents%20food%20and%20culture.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ENow%2C%20he's%20lived%20in%20Shanghai%20for%2012%20years%20and%20says%20it's%20where%20he%20feels%20most%20at%20home.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Graeme%20Kennedy%2C%20a%20Canadian%20photographer%20based%20in%20Shanghai.%20His%20words%20have%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20grew%20up%20in%20a%20small%20town%20in%20the%20Canadian%20Rockies%20in%20the%20kind%20of%20place%20where%20you%20help%20your%20neighbor%20shovel%20snow%20off%20their%20sidewalk%20just%20because.%20My%20childhood%20was%20spent%20climbing%20trees%2C%20biking%2C%20and%20skiing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESadly%2C%20the%20nature%20that%20drew%20in%20tourists%20year-round%20was%20lost%20on%20me.%20I%20wanted%20to%20get%20out%20of%20that%204%2C000-person%20town.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EHave%20you%20relocated%20abroad%20%E2%80%94%20especially%20to%20Asia%20%E2%80%94%20for%20career%20opportunities%2C%20retirement%2C%20or%20lower%20living%20costs%3F%20We%20want%20to%20hear%20from%20you.%20Fill%20out%20this%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%20noreferrer%20nofollow%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fforms%2Fd%2Fe%2F1FAIpQLSdxVL1zX0AV0FiTKnYB72xTcK5G4gxa8o5PwKsxTEwmgZJg1A%2Fviewform%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eshort%20form%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20share%20your%20story%20with%20a%20reporter.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EAt%2018%2C%20I%20moved%20to%20Thailand%20to%20work%20in%20a%20school's%20marketing%20department%2C%20then%20to%20London%20for%20two%20years%2C%20and%20finally%2C%20in%20a%20bold%20leap%2C%20to%20Shanghai%20in%202014.%20Despite%20my%20narrow%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgen-z-china-capitalism-infrastructure-trains-traditional-chinese-medicine-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eunderstanding%20of%20China%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20fueled%20by%20the%20politically-charged%20headlines%20that%20often%20painted%20a%20gray%20picture%2C%20I%20bought%20a%20one-way%20ticket.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226abb0dca-0819-4bf0-ae31-8d0ad31cde26%5C%22%3ELanding%20in%20China%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20first%20five%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-living-in-china-hard-to-relate-friends-back-home-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eyears%20in%20Shanghai%3C%2Fa%3E%20were%20spent%20in%20marketing%20and%20creative%20direction%20for%20a%20British%20international%20school%20and%20a%20luxury%20hospitality%20company.%20It%20was%20stable%20work%2C%20but%20I%20felt%20a%20growing%20discontent.%20The%20allure%20of%20China's%20vastness%20extended%20far%20beyond%20the%20confines%20of%20a%209-to-6%20office%20desk.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPhotography%20had%20always%20been%20my%20passion%2C%20a%20key%20that%20opened%20doors%20and%20offered%20glimpses%20into%20the%20lives%20of%20others.%20It%20had%20provided%20me%20with%20an%20excuse%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvisited-every-country-best-cities-sydney-valletta-krabi-worst-delhi-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etravel%20with%20purpose%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20engage%20with%20the%20world%20more%20deeply.%20Whether%20photographing%20mushroom%20harvesting%20in%20Lishui%20or%20documenting%20cacao%20production%20in%20Tanzania%2C%20each%20click%20of%20the%20shutter%20drew%20me%20closer%20to%20understanding%20life's%20complexities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20motto%2C%20%26quot%3BJust%20say%20yes%2C%26quot%3B%20became%20a%20guiding%20principle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227008%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20man%20photographing%20a%20duck%20farm%20in%20Beijing%2C%20China.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c13e287737bff3ebd9c47%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224672%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EKennedy%20taking%20photos%20at%20a%20duck%20farm%20in%20Beijing.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Greame%20Kennedy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e15d5c12-bcc5-4748-bab2-0f5a2aa8c4a9%5C%22%3ENo%20formal%20training%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20never%20studied%20photography%3B%20I%20taught%20myself.%20Whether%20I%20was%20shooting%20for%20a%20school%20newspaper%20or%20creating%20day-to-day%20content%20for%20a%20marketing%20department%2C%20photography%20was%20always%20connected%20to%20the%20work%20I%20was%20doing.%20I%20just%20never%20thought%20it%20could%20be%20a%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20my%20last%20full-time%20job%2C%20I%20started%20taking%20on%20photography%20work%20on%20the%20side%20to%20make%20some%20extra%20money.%20I'd%20done%20a%20few%20shoots%20on%20weekends%20and%20evenings%2C%20but%20without%20a%20business%2C%20I%20couldn't%20legally%20accept%20payments.%20Starting%20a%20company%20felt%20daunting%2C%20but%20I%20eventually%20realized%20the%20rewards%20outweighed%20the%20risks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202019%2C%20I%20launched%20my%20own%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fphotography-business-how-to-start-freelance-creative-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ephotography%20company.%3C%2Fa%3E%20I%20made%20very%20little%20at%20first%2C%20but%20once%20everything%20was%20set%20up%2C%20I%20could%20finally%20accept%20payments%20from%20clients%20who%20had%20been%20waiting%20to%20pay%20me.%20That%20gave%20me%20enough%20to%20get%20through%20the%20first%20couple%20of%20months.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225760%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Posing%20in%20China%20wiht%20founders%20of%20Chalu%20Sparkling%20tea.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c32e097a2276a3423baa5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224320%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWhen%20he%20started%20his%20career%20in%20photography%2C%20he%20took%20on%20almost%20any%20project%20he%20could%20get.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Graeme%20Kennedy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20first%2C%20I%20was%20earning%20less%20than%2020%2C000%20RMB%20a%20month%20%E2%80%94%20barely%20enough%20to%20cover%20rent%2C%20food%2C%20and%20new%20camera%20gear.%20I%20took%20almost%20any%20project%20I%20could%20get%2C%20often%20for%20free%2C%20shooting%20friends'%20restaurants%2C%20events%2C%20gyms%2C%20and%20bars.%20The%20goal%20wasn't%20to%20make%20a%20lot%20of%20money%20right%20away.%20It%20was%20to%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-build-a-portfolio-rental-properties-real-estate-investing-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20build%20a%20portfolio%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20stay%20busy%2C%20and%20earn%20referrals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWithin%20a%20year%2C%20those%20connections%20and%20the%20work%20I%20put%20in%20led%20to%20bigger%20jobs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbecoming-your-own-boss-solo-business-entrepreneur-job-market-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWorking%20for%20myself%20%3C%2Fa%3Ehas%20meant%20slow%20months%2C%20expensive%20months%2C%20and%20windfall%20months.%20There%20were%20anxious%20nights%20waiting%20for%20payments%20so%20I%20could%20pay%20my%20staff%2C%20but%20it%20was%20never%20just%20about%20making%20money.%20The%20chaos%20is%20mine%20to%20be%20proud%20of.%20I%20get%20to%20travel%2C%20set%20my%20own%20schedule%2C%20and%20know%20that%20the%20effort%20I%20put%20in%20benefits%20me%20directly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227fc7be0a-bd49-4a8c-ac3d-ea37abe7d4cb%5C%22%3EFinding%20stories%20through%20food%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20though%20I'm%20more%20involved%20in%20the%20business%20side%20these%20days%2C%20I%20still%20love%20being%20a%20photographer.%20Food%20has%20become%20a%20big%20focus%20of%20my%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20mom%20was%20a%20dietitian%2C%20so%20I%20grew%20up%20appreciating%20the%20stories%20behind%20what%20we%20eat.%20To%20me%2C%20food%20isn't%20just%20something%20you%20consume%20%E2%80%94%20it%20says%20a%20lot%20about%20a%20culture%20and%20a%20community.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20fascinated%20by%20everything%20that%20goes%20into%20making%20local%20dishes%2C%20from%20the%20people%20growing%20the%20ingredients%20to%20the%20kitchens%20where%20they're%20prepared.%20That's%20what%20motivates%20my%20photography.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228640%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20men%20having%20tea%20in%20Yunnan%2C%20China.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c0b5aa62e6e00bc538e92%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225760%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EKennedy%20started%20a%20documentary%20series%20with%20Christopher%20St.%20Cavish.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Graeme%20Kennedy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20recently%20co-started%20the%20%26quot%3BSaintCavish%26quot%3B%20YouTube%20documentary%20series%20with%20a%20writer%2C%20Christopher%20St.%20Cavish%2C%20which%2C%20despite%20bootstrapping%20on%20a%20tight%20budget%20with%20a%20crew%20of%20under%20five%20people%2C%20got%20nominated%20for%20a%20James%20Beard%20Award.%20People%20in%20the%20West%20are%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthe-ultimate-guide-for-taking-a-robotaxi-in-china-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecurious%20about%20China%3C%2Fa%3E.%20When%20our%20first%20season%20got%2015%20million%20views%2C%20we%20knew%20we%20were%20onto%20something.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229519437a-db9d-4ec8-94df-87c5c77f1cdc%5C%22%3EWhere%20is%20Home%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ELooking%20back%2C%20I've%20realized%20that%20home%20isn't%20as%20straightforward%20as%20I%20once%20thought.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20people%20who%20live%20overseas%2C%20it's%20shaped%20by%20the%20experiences%20you%20have%2C%20the%20people%20around%20you%2C%20and%20how%20you%20change%20over%20time.%20When%20I%20first%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fandrew-moo-moved-to-china-embrace-heritage-yayas-restaurateur-shanghai-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emoved%20to%20Shanghai%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20I%20thought%20I'd%20only%20stay%20for%20a%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYet%20a%20decade%20later%2C%20I%20still%20have%20the%20keys%20to%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchinese-millennial-decided-not-to-have-kids-money-time-career-2025-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eapartment%20in%20Shanghai%3C%2Fa%3E.%20I've%20put%20down%20roots%20here%2C%20surrounded%20by%20a%20community%20of%20creatives%20and%20entrepreneurs%20who%20have%20become%20like%20family.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20visit%20my%20family%20in%20Canada%20from%20time%20to%20time%2C%20but%20Shanghai%20is%20where%20I%20feel%20most%20at%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-shanghai-china-career-change-photography-home-saint-cavish-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785714421000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c134287737bff3ebd9c46%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-shanghai-china-career-change-photography-home-saint-cavish-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Graeme%20Kennedy%20expected%20to%20spend%20one%20year%20in%20Shanghai.%20Instead%2C%20he%20built%20a%20photography%20business%20and%20found%20a%20passion%20for%20telling%20China's%20food%20stories.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Sophie%20Steiner)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%2210%2C000%20cases%20pending%20in%20SC%20for%2010%20yrs%2C%2080%2C000%20in%20HCs%20for%2030%20yrs%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785714005000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132815737%2Cimgsize-703971.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Findia%2F10000-cases-pending-in-sc-for-10-yrs-80000-in-hcs-for-30-yrs%2Farticleshow%2F132815732.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Despite%20significant%20investment%2C%20court%20infrastructure%20and%20technology%20have%20not%20reduced%20decades-old%20case%20pendency.%20Over%20ten%20thousand%20cases%20remain%20pending%20in%20the%20Supreme%20Court%20for%20more%20than%20ten%20years.%20High%20courts%20across%20India%20have%2