0abroad%20for%20adventure%20and%20a%20new%20lease%20on%20life.%20She%20realized%20she%20had%20forgotten%20to%20change%20some%20of%20her%20habits%20along%20the%20way.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Carmen%20Esselink.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI%20set%20off%20on%20starting%20my%20new%20nomadic%20life%20and%20headed%20to%20Cape%20Verde.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20ended%20up%20staying%20put%20and%20dating%20the%20same%20type%20of%20people%20I%20thought%20I%20was%20trying%20to%20escape%20at%20home.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ENow%2C%20I'm%20not%20sure%20what%20I'm%20chasing%2C%20but%20I'm%20trying%20to%20be%20true%20to%20myself%20and%20my%20needs.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ENine%20days%20into%202025%2C%20I%20stood%20at%20gate%20G7%20in%20Amsterdam%20waiting%20to%20board%20my%20flight%20to%20Cape%20Verde%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Femotional-cost-to-moving-abroad-nomadic-life-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebuild%20a%20nomadic%20life%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20my%20own%20terms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20year%20and%20a%20half%20later%2C%20strangely%20enough%2C%20I'm%20still%20here.%20The%20temporary%20adventure%20turned%20into%20a%20life%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdigital-nomad-life-was-hard-established-routine-notion-daily-schedule-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecomplete%20with%20friends%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20routines%2C%20and%20a%20man%20who%2C%20after%20nine%20months%2C%20still%20isn't%20ready%20to%20call%20me%20his%20girlfriend.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENone%20of%20it%20was%20exactly%20planned.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226a4b5b39-4a60-4d28-8272-54633c4f3ca9%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20needed%20a%20new%20path%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20another%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdating-couple-started-business-failed-relationship-married-2024-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edating%20failure%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20stalled%20job%2C%20and%20a%20roommate%20moving%20out%2C%20I%20felt%20stuck%20on%20the%20traditional%20path%20that%20includes%20a%20career%2C%20a%20mortgage%2C%20and%20maybe%20marriage%2C%20and%20more.%20It%20was%20a%20path%20I%20wasn't%20even%20sure%20I%20wanted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeanwhile%2C%20friends%20around%20me%20seemed%20busy%20making%20things%20permanent%3A%20getting%20engaged%2C%20buying%20houses%2C%20merging%20lives%20and%20bank%20accounts%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frealized-didnt-want-kids-after-seeing-friends-have-them-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehaving%20kids%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENaturally%2C%20I%20choose%20the%20opposite%3A%20unsettle.%20I%20quit%20my%20job%2C%20moved%20out%20of%20my%20apartment%2C%20ditched%20many%20of%20my%20belongings%2C%20and%20left.%20I%20was%20after%20an%20adventure%2C%20but%20somehow%20I%20ended%20up%20staying%20at%20the%20first%20stop%20I%20made%3A%20Cape%20Verde.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222388%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20poses%20on%20a%20ladder.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c9ade87737bff3ebd9dd0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223184%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20she%20was%20still%20drawn%20to%20the%20same%20types%20of%20people%2C%20even%20though%20she%20had%20changed%20many%20other%20things.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Carmen%20Esselink.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOver%20the%20next%2018%20months%2C%20I%20dated%20four%20people.%20Despite%20changing%20my%20coordinates%2C%20career%2C%20and%20cultural%20context%2C%20I%20still%20find%20myself%20drawn%20to%20the%20same%20emotionally%20unavailable%20partners%20I%20had%20back%20home.%20Only%20now%20with%20different%20passports.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22135843df-8a6c-48ce-a3a6-cbf15cc86df1%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20was%20in%20a%20textbook%20situationship%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsituationship-dating-trend-young-singles-relationship-status-gen-z-2023-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esituationship%20I%20was%20in%3C%2Fa%3E%20by%20month%20three%20of%20my%20nomadic%20life%20could%20have%20come%20straight%20out%20of%20a%20psychologist's%20textbook.%20When%20he%20pulled%20away%20after%20two%20months%2C%20I%20noticed%20immediately%3A%20less%20time%2C%20shorter%20text%20replies%2C%20and%20plans%20that%20stay%20plans%20rather%20than%20actions.%20I%20was%20anxiously%20looking%20for%20clarity%20where%20there%20often%20was%20none.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20we%20were%20about%20to%20become%20intimate%20for%20the%20first%20time%2C%20he%20suddenly%20felt%20nauseous.%20He%20blamed%20an%20expired%20yogurt%20he%20had%20eaten%20on%20his%20way%20to%20my%20place.%20I'm%20not%20proud%20to%20admit%20it%2C%20but%20I%20checked%20the%20container%20that%20was%20lying%20in%20my%20bin.%20The%20expiration%20date%20was%20a%20week%20away.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20knew%20the%20yogurt%20wasn't%20the%20reason.%20More%20importantly%2C%20I%20realized%20the%20reason%20didn't%20matter.%20A%20lie%2C%20even%20a%20small%20one%2C%20is%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fred-flags-bad-business-partner-co-founder-startup-relationship-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ered%20flag%3C%2Fa%3E.%20But%20I%20rationalized%20every%20red%20flag%20with%20%26quot%3Bthis%20time%20it%20will%20be%20different%26quot%3B%2C%20instead%20of%20accepting%20what%20was%20in%20front%20of%20me%3A%20minimal%20effort.%20And%20it%20was%20not%20the%20yogurt%2C%20but%20our%20situationship%20that%20had%20reached%20the%20expiration%20date.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20he%20said%20he%20had%20to%20move%20to%20another%20island%20for%20work%20within%20a%20week.%20When%20his%20plane%20left%2C%20I%20told%20myself%20I%20was%20fine.%20Sure%2C%20fine%20looked%20a%20lot%20like%20me%20crying%20on%20my%20pink%20yoga%20mat%2C%20trying%20to%20meditate%20my%20way%20out%20of%20another%20heartbreak.%20%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3EA%20month%20later%2C%20I%20learned%20he%20was%20in%20a%20relationship%20with%20someone%20else.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22811b437c-48a5-4ca3-9769-ad367a113f5d%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWas%20I%20building%20a%20life%20or%20avoiding%20one%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20original%20plan%20was%20to%20experiment%20with%20nomad%20life%2C%20to%20move%20around%2C%20meet%20people%2C%20experience%20new%20things%20and%20locations.%20Instead%2C%20I%20found%20myself%20staying%3A%20not%20only%20for%20the%20place%2C%20but%20for%20the%20idea%20of%20an%20%26quot%3Bus%26quot%3B%20that%20wasn't%20there.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223264%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20points%20to%20a%20rocky%20cliff.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6c9b26a62e6e00bc53902b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221472%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20she%20rejected%20the%20%26quot%3Bsettle%20down%26quot%3B%20script%20for%20years.%20Now%20she's%20trying%20to%20determine%20what%20she%20really%20wants.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Carmen%20Esselink.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20years%2C%20while%20friends%20were%20moving%20toward%20settling%20down%20and%20procreating%2C%20I%20ran%20as%20fast%20as%20I%20could%20from%20that%20script%2C%20instead%20focusing%20on%20my%20career%2C%20autonomy%2C%20and%20adventure.%20Now%20I'm%20unsure%20whether%20I'm%20building%20a%20life%20or%20avoiding%20one.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaybe%20my%20move%20wasn't%20only%20about%20chasing%20freedom%20or%20happiness%2C%20but%20also%20about%20being%20convinced%20I'd%20find%20it%20in%20adventure%20and%20reinvention.%20Maybe%20I%20was%20partially%20postponing%20something%20I%20wasn't%20ready%20to%20face%3A%20I%20dream%20about%20being%20someone's%20someone%20%E2%80%94%20no%20matter%20my%20location.%20I%20didn't%20cry%20on%20that%20yoga%20mat%20because%20I%20wanted%20adventure.%20I%20cried%20because%2C%20deep%20down%2C%20I%20am%20so%20scared%20I%20won't%20get%20my%20happily-ever-after%20fairytale.%20That%20was%20something%20I%20wasn't%20even%20sure%20I%20knew%20I%20wanted.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20came%20across%20the%20concept%20of%20self-handicapping%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-be-more-powerful-2011-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecreating%20conditions%20that%20protect%20us%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20confronting%20our%20deepest%20fear.%20Perhaps%20chasing%20unavailable%20partners%20and%20going%20abroad%20served%20that%20function%2C%20as%20external%20obstacles%20I%20can%20blame.%20As%20long%20as%20things%20remain%20uncertain%2C%20it's%20not%20my%20fault%20when%20things%20don't%20work%20out.%20But%20I%20have%20my%20flaws%2C%20too%2C%20and%20this%20blame%20game%20doesn't%20prevent%20me%20from%20getting%20hurt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2284dcd589-5dcc-471c-b914-43d6d65bce6e%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThings%20look%20different%20now%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EToday%2C%20I'm%20building%20something%20more%20committed%20with%20someone%20sweet%2C%20funny%2C%20hardworking%2C%20and%20%E2%80%94%20yes%2C%20again%2C%20a%20bit%20avoidant.%20So%20am%20I%20self-sabotaging%3F%20Repeating%20patterns%3F%20Is%20it%20bad%20luck%3F%20Or%20simply%20the%20risk%20of%20letting%20someone%20in%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20I%20am%2C%20trying%20not%20to%20repeat%20that%20anxiety-driven%20template.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20difference%20today%3F%20I%20no%20longer%20guess%2C%20but%20ask%20the%20difficult%20questions%2C%20recognize%20patterns%2C%20and%20communicate%20needs%2C%20boundaries%2C%20fears%2C%20and%20triggers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETime%20will%20tell%20whether%20this%20new%20relationship%20becomes%20part%20of%20a%20path%20forward%20or%20a%20pattern%20from%20the%20past.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-abroad-reinvent-myself-forgot-to-change-dating-habits-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785702841000%2C%2