om%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fus-scientists-analysed-55-storm-and-atmospheric-variables-to-identify-hurricane-rapid-intensification-atlantic-communities-could-receive-warnings-as-much-as-five-days-ahead%2Famp_articleshow%2F132810673.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fus-scientists-analysed-55-storm-and-atmospheric-variables-to-identify-hurricane-rapid-intensification-atlantic-communities-could-receive-warnings-as-much-as-five-days-ahead%2Famp_articleshow%2F132810673.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22What%20smart%20people%20are%20saying%20about%20Trump%20Media%20charging%20for%20early%20access%20to%20the%20president's%20Truth%20Social%20posts%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225131%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Donald%20Trump%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6f52c2a62e6e00bc5398d9%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223421%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETrump%20Media%20%26amp%3B%20Technology%20Group%20launched%20Truth%20API%20on%20Saturday.%3Cp%3EAaron%20Schwartz%20%2F%20AFP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ETrump%20Media%20launched%20Truth%20API%20on%20Saturday.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETruth%20API%20sells%20early%20access%20to%20posts%20from%20prominent%20Truth%20Social%20users%20like%20President%20Donald%20Trump.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EReuters%20reported%20that%20Trump%20Media%20considered%20selling%20that%20access%20for%20%24100%2C000%20a%20month.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThere's%20a%20new%20way%20to%20make%20and%20lose%20money.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETrump%20Media%20has%20officially%20launched%20the%20Truth%20API%2C%20a%20business-to-business%20data%20feed%20that%20provides%20customers%20with%20faster%20access%20to%20posts%20from%20prominent%20Truth%20Social%20accounts.%20That%20includes%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdonald-trump%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPresident%20Donald%20Trump%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20whose%20constant%20stream%20of%20posts%20can%20cause%20shifts%20in%20financial%20markets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstitutional%20customers%20gained%20access%20to%20the%20service%20on%20Saturday.%20A%20few%20hours%20later%2C%20Trump%20announced%20on%20Truth%20Social%20that%20he%20was%2C%20again%2C%20close%20to%20a%20deal%20to%20end%20his%20war%20on%20Iran.%20On%20any%20other%20day%2C%20that%20post%20would%20have%20affected%20oil%20futures%2C%20and%20anyone%20with%20early%20access%20could%20have%20made%20a%20buck.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMarkets%20already%20move%20on%20Truth%20Social%20posts%2C%26quot%3B%20Kevin%20McGurn%2C%20interim%20CEO%20of%20Trump%20Media%2C%20said%20in%20a%20press%20release.%20%26quot%3BTruth%20API%20delivers%20a%20direct%2C%20licensed%2C%20real-time%20feed%20of%20the%20platform's%20most%20market-moving%20Truths%20while%20advancing%20our%20strategy%20to%20monetize%20proprietary%20assets%20through%20a%20high-margin%2C%20recurring%20revenue%20stream.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETrump%20Media%20has%20not%20publicly%20disclosed%20how%20much%20the%20service%20is%20costing%20customers.%20Reuters%20reported%20that%20the%20company%20discussed%20charging%20up%20to%20%24100%2C000%20a%20month%2C%20or%20%2460%2C000%20a%20month%20as%20part%20of%20a%20three-year%20plan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20whole%20thing%20got%20people%20talking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20what%20smart%20people%20in%20finance%2C%20academia%2C%20and%20policy%20are%20saying%20about%20Truth%20API.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJim%20Bianco%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbanking-system-crisis-recession-bond-market-stocks-svb-signature-bianco-2023-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJim%20Bianco%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20the%20president%20of%20Bianco%20Research%2C%20a%20market%20analysis%20firm%2C%20said%20in%20a%20post%20on%20X%20that%20Truth%20API%20could%20result%20in%20%26quot%3Bmore%20frequent%20market-moving%20posts%26quot%3B%20on%20the%20social%20media%20site.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BTrump%20will%20want%20them%20to%20be%20happy%20with%20their%20new%20service%2C%26quot%3B%20Bianco%20wrote%20on%20Saturday%2C%20referring%20to%20Truth%20API%20customers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EShaun%20Maguire%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fshaun-maguire-sequoia-vc-gop-trump-supporter-backlash-zohran-mamdani-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EShaun%20Maguire%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20venture%20capitalist%20and%20partner%20at%20Sequoia%20Capital%20who%20is%20a%20vocal%20supporter%20of%20Trump%2C%20said%20he%20isn't%20a%20fan%20of%20the%20service%20in%20an%20X%20post%20on%20Sunday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMoves%20like%20this%20cheapen%20Trump's%20policy%20wins%20(of%20which%20there%20have%20been%20many)%2C%26quot%3B%20Maguire%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EDean%20Baker%3Cp%3EDean%20Baker%2C%20cofounder%20of%20the%20Center%20for%20Economic%20and%20Policy%20Research%2C%20said%20the%20service%20may%20work%20at%20the%20expense%20of%20everyday%20Americans.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAnd%2C%20since%20reporters%20are%20too%20lazy%20to%20tell%20people%2C%20the%20money%20that%20insider%20traders%20pocket%20is%20money%20taken%20from%20the%20401(k)s%20and%20IRAs%20of%20normal%20people%20who%20work%20for%20a%20living%2C%26quot%3B%20Baker%20said%20in%20an%20X%20post%20on%20Saturday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJames%20Surowiecki%3Cp%3EOn%20Sunday%2C%20finance%20journalist%20and%20author%20James%20Surowiecki%20said%20he%20believes%20Truth%20API%20violates%20insider%20trading%20laws.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BTrump%20is%20disclosing%20information%20(in%20this%20case%2C%20information%20about%20some%20of%20his%20future%20public%20statements%20as%20president%2C%20including%20statements%20about%20policy)%20that%20belongs%20to%20the%20US%20government%20in%20exchange%20for%20money.%20That%20violates%20his%20duty%20of%20trust%20and%20confidence%20to%20his%20employer%20(the%20govt)%2C%20and%20is%20illegal%2C%26quot%3B%20Surowiecki%20said%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BAnd%20anyone%20who%20pays%20for%20the%20feed%20is%20knowingly%20paying%20for%20misappropriated%20information%2C%20which%20is%20illegal%20as%20well.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJason%20Calacanis%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAll-In%26quot%3B%20podcast%20cohost%20Jason%20Calacanis%20said%20the%20Truth%20API%20was%20evidence%20that%20those%20close%20to%20Trump%20aren't%20giving%20him%20%26quot%3Bgood%20feedback.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThey're%20simply%20too%20scared%20to%20lose%20their%20position%20close%20to%20the%20Oval%20to%20just%20say%20'this%20is%20a%20very%20dumb%20idea.'%20Everyone%20needs%20someone%20who%20says%20'that's%20a%20dumb%20idea'%20around%20them%20%E2%80%94%20especially%20successful%20people%2C%26quot%3B%20Calacanis%20said%20on%20Sunday.%20%26quot%3BThe%20country%20is%20going%20to%20have%20endless%2C%20justified%20investigations%20into%20these%20'projects.'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20separate%20post%2C%20Calacanis%20said%3A%20%26quot%3BImagine%20you're%20running%20the%20SEC%20and%20the%20administration%20says%20for%20%241.2m%20a%20year%20he%20will%20let%20you%20front%20run%20the%20market!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJoe%20Saluzzi%3Cp%3EJoe%20Saluzzi%2C%20cofounder%20of%20Themis%20Trading%2C%20a%20brokerage%20for%20institutional%20investors%2C%20said%20in%20an%20interview%20with%20the%20Associated%20Press%20that%20Truth%20API%20will%20enable%20its%20customers%20to%20bypass%20other%20traders.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSomebody%20who%20buys%20the%20info%20and%20has%20a%20system%20built%20to%20process%20it%20will%20be%20able%20to%20act%20quicker%20than%20you%20and%20me%2C%26quot%3B%20Saluzzi%20said.%20%26quot%3BThe%20loser%20is%20always%20the%20retail%20investor.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EZach%20Everson%3Cp%3EOn%20Bluesky%2C%20Zach%20Everson%2C%20the%20director%20of%20Public%20Citizen's%20Trump%20Accountability%20Project%2C%20called%20the%20notion%20that%20Trump%20wouldn't%20profit%20during%20a%20presidency%20a%20%26quot%3Bfarce.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBut%20you're%20telling%20me%20Trump%20Media%20decided%20to%20sell%20Wall%20Street%20the%20fastest%20access%20to%20Trump's%20posts%20without%20running%20it%20by%20him%20first%3F%26quot%3B%20Everson%20said%20after%20the%20service%20was%20first%20announced.%20The%20president%20owns%20a%20majority%20stake%20in%20Trump%20Media.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EVuk%20Vukovic%3Cp%3EVuk%20Vukovi%C4%87%2C%20founding%20partner%20of%20hedge%20fund%20Oraclum%20Capital%2C%20said%20on%20X%20that%20his%20team%20would%20compare%20Trump's%20Truth%20Social%20posts%20with%20market%20reactions%20to%20determine%20whether%20there%20were%20any%20%26quot%3Bmeaningful%20signals.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSpoiler%3A%20there%20aren't%2C%26quot%3B%20Vukovi%C4%87%20said%20on%20Sunday.%20%26quot%3BThe%20tweets%20are%20complete%20noise.%20Even%20when%20you%20capture%20a%20few%20strong%20moves%20before%20they%20happen%2C%20you%20will%20lose%20so%20much%20on%20the%20rest%20of%20it%20that%20it's%20not%20worth%20it.%20He%20simply%20tweets%20too%20much%2C%20and%2090%25%20of%20the%20time%2C%20the%20market%20doesn't%20react%20at%20all.%20When%20it%20does%2C%20sometimes%20it's%20even%20the%20opposite%20of%20what%20you%20might%20expect.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVukovi%C4%87%20said%20people%20who%20buy%20options%20or%20futures%20each%20time%20Trump%20makes%20a%20Truth%20Social%20post%20will%20likely%20see%20losses%20offset%20gains.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAll%20in%20all%2C%20he's%20selling%20you%20noise%2C%26quot%3B%20Vukovi%C4%87%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20would%20avoid%20buying%20this%20both%20on%20principle%20and%20on%20the%20fact%20that%20you're%20buying%20snake%20oil.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-truth-social-early-access-api-markets-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785692413000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6f52cd97a2276a3423c494%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-truth-social-early-access-api-markets-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Trump%20Media%20launched%20Truth%20API%20on%20Saturday%2C%20allowing%20early%20access%20to%20posts%20from%20prominent%20Truth%20Social%20accounts%2C%20including%20President%20Donald%20Trump's.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22ledmonds%40businessinsider.com%20(Lauren%20Edmonds)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Petrol%2C%20Diesel%20Sales%20In%20India%20Rise%20By%20Up%20To%2010%25%20Year-On-Year%20In%20July%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22Petrol%20sales%20of%20the%20three%20oil%20biggies%20increased%20by%209.7%20per%20cent%20to%203.45%20million%20tonnes%20in%20July%20this%20year%2C%20compared%20with%203.14%20million%20tonnes%20in%20the%20corresponding%20month%20last%20year.%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785692153000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fc.ndtvimg.com%2F2026-07%2F8ao7otoo_petrol-diesel-price-today_625x300_27_July_26.png%3Fim%3DFeatureCrop%2Calgorithm%3Ddnn%2Cwidth%3D1280%2Cheight%3D720%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Fpetrol-diesel-sales-in-india-rise-by-up-to-10-year-on-year-in-july-11856843%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Petrol%20sales%20of%20the%20three%20oil%20biggies%20increased%20by%209.7%20per%20cent%20to%203.45%20million%20tonnes%20in%20July%20this%20year%2C%20compared%20with%203.14%20million%20tonnes%20in%20the%20corresponding%20month%20last%20year.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Fpetrol-diesel-sales-in-india-rise-by-up-to-10-year-on-year-in-july-11856843%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-ndtv-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Fpetrol-diesel-sales-in-india-rise-by-up-to-10-year-on-year-in-july-11856843%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Findia-news%2Fpetrol-diesel-sales-in-india-rise-by-up-to-10-year-on-year-in-july-11856843%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20toddler%E2%80%99s%20jet%20lag%20had%20us%20roaming%20Tokyo%20before%20dawn.%20We%20saw%20a%20side%20of%20the%20city%20most%20tourists%20miss.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222722%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mom%20and%20toddler%20posing%20for%20photo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67957ace52cb26b8394595%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222041%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20flew%20form%20the%20US%20to%20Japan%20with%20her%20toddler.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI%20traveled%20from%20San%20Diego%20to%20Tokyo%20with%20my%204-year-old%20daughter.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EJet%20lag%20meant%20predawn%20convenience-store%20runs%2C%20naps%2C%20and%20a%20few%20public%20meltdowns.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWaking%20early%20also%20let%20us%20experience%20a%20quieter%20side%20of%20Tokyo%20that%20most%20tourists%20miss.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAt%203%3A47%20a.m.%2C%20my%20daughter%20sat%20fully%20upright%20in%20bed%2C%20wide%20awake%20and%20ready%20to%20start%20the%20day.%20It%20was%20still%20dark%20outside%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcapsule-hotel-tokyo-what-its-like-spend-night-2023-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehotel%20room%20in%20Tokyo%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20trying%20to%20explain%20time%20zones%20to%20a%204-year-old%20is%20futile.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20never%20struggled%20with%20jet%20lag.%20I%20run%20on%20caffeine%20and%20enthusiasm%20until%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchronotype-biological-clock-circadian-rhythm-morning-person-2017-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecircadian%20rhythm%3C%2Fa%3E%20catches%20up%2C%20and%20within%20a%20day%20or%20two%2C%20I've%20adjusted.%20But%20a%2016-hour%20time%20difference%20is%20a%20different%20problem%20with%20a%20preschooler%20in%20tow%2C%20one%20that's%20hard%20to%20manage%2C%20let%20alone%20explain%20to%20someone%20whose%20body%20is%20telling%20them%20it's%20noon%20even%20though%20the%20sky%20is%20dark.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ca714724-965f-4cd4-8829-5d8c1cd352cf%5C%22%3EWe%20flew%20from%20California%20to%20Tokyo%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWe'd%20flown%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpacking-regrets-on-12-hour-flight-to-tokyo-2023-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESan%20Diego%20to%20Tokyo%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20the%20first%20stop%20on%20a%20long%20trip%20through%20Asia.%20We%20took%20a%20red-eye%20I%20had%20booked%20because%20it%20was%20the%20only%20direct%20flight%2C%20without%20thinking%20through%20the%20arrival%20schedule%3B%20we%20landed%20at%20Narita%20at%20what%20felt%20like%201%20a.m.%20to%20our%20bodies%2C%20after%20only%20a%20few%20hours%20of%20sleep.%20By%20the%20time%20we'd%20wearily%20cleared%20customs%20and%20immigration%20and%20made%20the%20hour-and-a-half%20drive%20into%20the%20city%2C%20the%20sun%20setting%20behind%20skyscrapers%2C%20we%20could%20barely%20tell%20if%20it%20was%20morning%2C%20evening%2C%20or%20night.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222848%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Toddler%20in%20a%20kimono%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a43a54f987526177a38e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221899%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20says%20that%20meltdowns%20were%20inevitable.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20picked%20Tokyo%20as%20our%20first%20stop%20intentionally.%20It's%20about%20as%20safe%20and%20efficient%20as%20a%20city%20gets%2C%20and%20I%20figured%20that%20ease%20would%20make%20for%20a%20gentler%20landing.%20What%20I%20hadn't%20fully%20considered%20was%20the%20flip%20side%3A%20a%20city%20built%20on%20quiet%20and%20orderly%20calm%2C%20plus%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-things-for-long-flight-with-little-kid-2022-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ejet%20lagged%204-year-old%3C%2Fa%3E%20who%20still%20learning%20to%20modulate%20her%20volume.%20I%20spent%20more%20time%20than%20I'd%20like%20to%20admit%20picturing%20her%20having%20a%20loud%2C%20public%20meltdown%20in%20Japan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d2d00cbe-b1ef-422e-a213-408c17c0e77e%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20first%20night%20is%20about%20damage%20control%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20checked%20into%20our%20hotel%20in%20the%20early%20evening%2C%20with%20immediate%20relief.%20The%20room%20was%20dark%20enough%20that%20I%20couldn't%20see%20my%20hand%20in%20front%20of%20my%20face%20once%20blackout%20curtains%20were%20pulled%20tight%20against%20a%20sky%20that%20hadn't%20fully%20gone%20down%20yet.%20I%20set%20up%20her%20inflatable%20toddler%20bed%2C%20and%20we%20were%20both%20sound%20asleep%20by%208%20p.m.%20local%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20planned%20to%20keep%20us%20resting%20quietly%20in%20the%20dark%20until%205%20a.m.%2C%20even%20if%20we%20woke%20up%20early.%20But%20when%20she%20sat%20up%20fully%20alert%20before%204%20a.m.%2C%20I%20had%20already%20been%20up%20for%20well%20over%20an%20hour%2C%20so%20we%20moved%20to%20plan%20B.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20walked%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2F7-eleven-favorite-spot-traveling-to-japan-2023-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eclosest%207-Eleven%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20split%20an%20egg%20salad%20sandwich%20and%20explore%20the%20neighborhood%20before%20dawn.%20Japanese%20convenience%20store%20food%20has%20a%20cult%20following%20for%20good%20reason%2C%20and%20at%204%3A30%20in%20the%20morning%2C%20it%20was%20the%20right%20mix%20of%20comforting%20and%20exciting.%20We%20ate%20it%20at%20Shiba%20Park%20nearby%2C%20dazed%2C%20watching%20a%20cluster%20of%20cosplay%20teens%20parade%20past%20in%20full%20costume.%20Then%2C%20we%20headed%20to%20the%20closest%20playground%2C%20which%20we%20were%20alone%20at%20except%20for%20a%20couple%20of%20stragglers%20that%20seemed%20to%20still%20be%20finishing%20their%20night%20from%20the%20nearby%20bar%20district.%20They%20kindly%20tossed%20their%20empty%20drink%20cans%20into%20recycling%20when%20they%20saw%20us%20approach%20and%20headed%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222163%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Girl%20choosing%20kimonos%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a5e454f987526177a395%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221622%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%204-year-old%20woke%20up%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20the%20night%20Tokyo%20time.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20wasn't%20until%20several%20hours%20later%2C%20once%20the%20hotel's%20actual%20breakfast%20buffet%20opened%2C%20that%20the%20magic%20of%20dawn%20slipped%20away%20and%20reality%20kicked%20in.%20%26quot%3BMOM%2C%20CAN%20YOU%20GET%20ME%20SOME%20FRUIT%3F%26quot%3B%20she%20shouted%2C%20from%20clear%20across%20the%20room.%20I%20tried%20giving%20her%20my%20best%20mom%20big-eyes%20and%20gestured%20for%20her%20to%20quietly%20come%20closer%20to%20me%2C%20but%20she%20shouted%20it%20again%2C%20louder%2C%20standing%20up%20on%20her%20chair.%20A%20room%20full%20of%20quietly%20eating%20guests%20did%20not%20react%2C%20which%20somehow%20made%20it%20worse.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22dcfc88cc-6d68-4ab8-902f-8647a4d55d09%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20got%20a%20kimono%20shoot%20with%20no%20one%20else%20around%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ETourist%20Japan%2C%20the%20travel%20agency%20that%20planned%20our%20Tokyo%20itinerary%2C%20arranged%20our%20pick%20up%20at%207%3A45%20a.m.%20for%20a%20kimono%20rental%20and%20professional%20photo%20shoot%20in%20Asakusa.%20The%20studio%20wasn't%20supposed%20to%20open%20that%20early%2C%20but%20every%20morning%20slot%20had%20already%20been%20booked%2C%20so%20they'd%20arranged%20for%20it%20to%20open%20early%20just%20for%20us.%20After%20the%20buffet%2C%20I%20was%20grateful%20for%20it%3A%20we%20had%20the%20entire%20place%20to%20ourselves%20before%20any%20other%20guests%20arrived%2C%20no%20crowds%20and%20no%20audience%20if%20the%20morning%20went%20sideways%20again.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222848%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mom%20and%20daughter%20in%20Tokyo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a679864ce52cb26b83945b1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221899%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20says%20that%20her%20toddler's%20jet%20lag%20was%20actually%20an%20advantage%20in%20Tokyo.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20didn't.%20We%20spent%20close%20to%20two%20hours%20in%20Asakusa%20being%20photographed%20in%20front%20of%20temple%20gates%20while%20she%20held%20still%2C%20wrapped%20up%20like%20a%20present%20and%20loving%20every%20minute.%20Back%20at%20the%20hotel%2C%20we%20took%20a%20two-hour%20nap%2C%20then%20afternoon%20karaoke%20to%20lure%20my%20tired%2C%20K-pop-loving%20daughter%20out%20of%20her%20bed%20and%20back%20out%20into%20the%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22895167c4-febf-432a-8cf7-a1d28baff06c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhen%20in%20doubt%2C%20get%20ice%20cream%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20day%20one%20is%20adrenaline%2C%20day%20two%20is%20when%20the%20bill%20comes%20due.%20We%20had%20a%20small-group%20Tourist%20Japan%20food%20tour%20through%20Tsukiji%20Market%20that%20morning%2C%20with%20an%208%20a.m.%20pickup.%20I%20felt%20cautiously%20optimistic%20walking%20in%2C%20since%20she'd%20slept%20until%205%20a.m.%20that%20morning%2C%20more%20than%20an%20hour%20later%20than%20the%20day%20before.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20optimism%20didn't%20survive%20contact%20with%20the%20market.%20Tsukiji%20at%20full%20volume%2C%20crowds%20pressing%20in%2C%20dead%20fish%20laid%20out%20everywhere%2C%20was%20more%20than%20my%204-year-old%20could%20handle.%20She%20spent%20the%20first%20half%20hour%20hiding%20under%20my%20skirt%2C%20until%20our%20tour%20guide%20crouched%20down%20and%20asked%20if%20she%20liked%20ice%20cream.%20She%20emerged%20an%20eager%2C%20fully%20engaged%20tourist%20for%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20morning%20fueled%20by%20chocolate%2C%20vanilla%2C%20and%20Japanese%20strawberries.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaybe%20it's%20that%20she's%20a%20born%20foodie%2C%20or%20maybe%20it's%20how%20meals%20help%20regulate%20our%20internal%20clocks%2C%20but%20eating%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20the%20most%20reliable%20cure%20for%20her%20jet%20lag%20the%20entire%20trip.%20That%20evening%2C%20we'd%20booked%20dinner%20at%20NiNi%2C%2038%20floors%20up%20at%201%20Hotel%20Tokyo%20with%20a%20panoramic%20view%20of%20the%20city%2C%20and%20it%20was%20the%20best%20meal%20of%20the%20trip.%20The%20restaurant%20brought%20out%20toys%20for%20her%20to%20play%20with%20at%20the%20table%2C%20and%20the%20wagyu%20hamburger%20steak%20off%20the%20kids'%20menu%20was%20good%20enough%20that%20I%20had%20to%20stop%20myself%20after%20stealing%20just%20one%20bite.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFood%20didn't%2C%20however%2C%20cure%20everything.%20Back%20at%20the%20hotel%2C%20someone%20else%20pressed%20the%20elevator%20%26quot%3Bup%26quot%3B%20button%20before%20she%20could%2C%20and%20once%20the%20tears%20started%2C%20they%20didn't%20quit.%20We%20were%20only%20a%20few%20floors%20from%20our%20room%2C%20and%20I%20have%20never%20been%20so%20relieved%20for%20a%20short%20ride.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226d3271a3-ca44-43f3-9d13-441e12148365%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EShe%20made%20me%20see%20Tokyo%20in%20a%20different%20way%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20unexpected%20advantage%20of%20traveling%20with%20a%20jet-lagged%20preschooler%20is%20that%20you%20see%20parts%20of%20a%20destination%20that%20most%20tourists%20might%20miss.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETokyo%20at%20sunrise%20feels%20entirely%20different%20from%20Tokyo%20at%20noon%3B%20it%20felt%20like%20getting%20a%20glimpse%20behind%20the%20curtain%20before%20the%20city%20officially%20opened.%20We%20lingered%20in%20small%20neighborhood%20parks.%20We%20spent%20time%20watching%20trains%20instead%20of%20rushing%20to%20the%20next%20attraction.%20We%20discovered%20quiet%20morning%20moments%20that%20weren't%20listed%20in%20any%20guidebook.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20meltdowns%20I'd%20braced%20for%20did%20come%2C%20but%20they%20weren't%20nearly%20as%20devastating%20as%20I%20had%20feared.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftokyo-with-preschooler-jet-lag-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785692041000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67957ace52cb26b8394595%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftokyo-with-preschooler-jet-lag-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22My%20preschooler%20woke%20before%204%20a.m.%20in%20Tokyo.%20Jet%20lag%20brought%20meltdowns%2C%20but%20it%20also%20helped%20us%20experience%20the%20city%20differently.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Michelle%20Stansbury)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Israel%2C%20US%20military%20learnt%20Trump%20cancelled%20Iran%20strike%20through%20social%20media%3A%20Report%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785691498000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132811034%2Cimgsize-96922.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fmiddle-east%2Fisrael-us-military-learnt-trump-cancelled-iran-strike-through-social-media-report%2Farticleshow%2F132810857.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F132810857.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3E%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Prisha%20Patnaik%22%2C%22engage