e%20become%20fine%20with%20dealing%20with%20the%20apartment's%20drawbacks.%3Cp%3EIsis%20O'Flynn-Shahaf%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20was%20younger%2C%20I%20always%20felt%20so%20grateful%20to%20live%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcelebrity-homes-in-the-west-village-2012-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20West%20Village%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20I%20was%20ignorant%20of%20many%20of%20the%20apartment's%20flaws%2C%20including%20its%20lack%20of%20built-in%20closets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EQuite%20literally%2C%20all%20the%20storage%20space%20I%20have%20had%20has%20come%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-interior-designer-would-never-get-at-ikea-what-to-buy%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EIkea%20dressers%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20wardrobes%20I%20built%20with%20my%20dad.%20Everything%20I%20own%20has%20to%20fit%20inside%20them%2C%20so%20I've%20learned%20to%20be%20extremely%20selective%20about%20what%20I%20keep%20in%20my%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20small%20space%20feels%20unnecessarily%20cluttered%20almost%20all%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20of%20the%20apartment's%20tight%20dimensions%20and%20strange%20layout%2C%20I%20have%20also%20become%20skilled%20at%20playing%20Tetris%20while%20furnishing%20and%20redecorating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20bathroom%20is%20directly%20adjacent%20to%20the%20front%20door%2C%20with%20the%20kitchen%20counter%20jutting%20out%20and%20blocking%20a%20significant%20portion%20of%20the%20already%20tiny%20walkway%20into%20the%20apartment.%20If%20the%20bathroom%20door%20is%20even%20halfway%20open%2C%20no%20one%20can%20get%20into%20or%20out%20of%20the%20apartment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22View%20of%20toilet%20with%20cabinet%20above%20it%20next%20to%20claw-foot%20tub%20in%20small%20bathroom%20next%20to%20different%20perspective%20of%20same%20space%2C%20white-tiled%20bathroom%20with%20tub%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a3d9de9360acd489560b927%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMaking%20a%20small%20space%20work%20can%20be%20challenging.%3Cp%3EIsis%20O'Flynn-Shahaf%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20layout%20also%20means%20that%20trying%20to%20lug%20a%20massive%20couch%2C%20mattress%2C%20or%20chairs%20into%20the%20living%20room%20requires%20multiple%20shifts%20of%20the%20object%20to%20find%20the%20pesky%20angles%20of%20the%20entranceway.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnfortunately%2C%20I've%20had%20to%20return%20a%20couch%20because%2C%20although%20it%20fit%20the%20dimensions%20of%20the%20apartment%2C%20it%20could%20not%20pass%20the%20bathroom-door-and-kitchen-countertop%20test.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228cf61309-0758-4bdc-85b8-54281f9d9fbd%5C%22%3EThe%20apartment's%20location%20and%20amenities%20aren't%20perfect%2C%20but%20the%20perks%20outweigh%20any%20drawbacks%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dimly%20lit%20room%20with%20bed%20next%20to%20window%20and%20nightstand%20with%20lamp%20beside%20bed%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a3d9e88e218c3b62535d5a0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20don't%20have%20any%20built-in%20closets%2C%20which%20regularly%20pushes%20me%20to%20be%20a%20minimalist.%3Cp%3EIsis%20O'Flynn-Shahaf%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20I%20open%20the%20curtains%20in%20the%20morning%2C%20I%20am%20greeted%20by%20a%20view%20of%20the%20walls%20of%20another%20apartment%20building%20and%20the%20trash.%20In%20the%20wintertime%2C%20sunlight%20is%20especially%20hard%20to%20come%20by%20in%20the%20space.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpeaking%20of%20winter%20%E2%80%94%20when%20it's%20cold%20outside%2C%20the%20radiator%20makes%20more%20noise%20than%20a%20dramatic%20soprano%20warming%20up%20in%20her%20dressing%20room.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20hisses%20and%20clangs%20so%20aggressively%20that%20when%20someone%20new%20is%20over%2C%20they'll%20ask%20if%20someone%20is%20breaking%20into%20the%20apartment.%20These%20sounds%20make%20it%20hard%20to%20fall%20asleep%20in%20the%20winter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%2C%20the%20radiator%20is%20scorching%20hot%20to%20the%20touch.%20If%20I%20accidentally%20bump%20into%20it%2C%20I'm%20walking%20away%20with%20a%20minor%20welt%20on%20my%20leg.%20But%20hey%2C%20at%20least%20I%20have%20heat%2C%20right%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dimly%20lit%20room%20with%20couch%2C%20keyboard%2C%20two%20windows%2C%20rug%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a3d9e7ce218c3b62535d59f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ESome%20parts%20of%20the%20apartment%20have%20been%20redecorated%20over%20time.%3Cp%3EIsis%20O'Flynn-Shahaf%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20lack%20of%20laundry%20in%20the%20building%20and%20the%20fact%20that%20the%20only%20sink%20is%20in%20the%20kitchen%20%E2%80%94%20there%20isn't%20one%20in%20the%20bathroom%20%E2%80%94%20isn't%20great%2C%20either.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20me%2C%20though%2C%20the%20true%20struggle%20is%20having%20two%20restaurants%20located%20under%20me%20on%20either%20side%20of%20the%20building.%20There's%20constant%20chatter%20and%20the%20slamming%20of%20doors%20that%20lead%20from%20the%20back%20of%20the%20restaurants%20to%20the%20trash%20chutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20bright%20side%2C%20it%20helps%20me%20never%20feel%20alone%2C%20which%20can%20be%20nice%20in%20a%20city%20that%20can%20feel%20isolating%20at%20times.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20also%20tend%20to%20put%20these%20qualms%20aside%20when%20I%20remember%20that%20I'm%20about%20a%20five-minute%20stroll%20from%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhudson-rivers-130-million-floating-park-2015-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHudson%20River%3C%2Fa%3E%20piers%20and%20a%2010-minute%20walk%20to%20several%20subway%20lines.%20Plus%2C%20one%20of%20the%20apartments%20above%20me%20recently%20got%20rented%20for%20more%20than%20double%20my%20rent%2C%20over%20%244%2C000%20a%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228ad83b27-34b1-46dd-a7f0-62c90407bebf%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20can't%20imagine%20giving%20up%20the%20community%20and%20security%20of%20this%20place%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228256%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Perry%20street%20in%20the%20West%20Village%20in%20the%20New%20York%20City%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4bdbdd5dc133dbf310d3a1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225504%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20West%20Village%20is%20a%20dream%20neighborhood%20for%20many.%3Cp%3EOndrej%20Bucek%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20all%20honesty%2C%20though%2C%20I%20feel%20like%20I%20have%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcourteney-cox-revisited-friends-apartment-nyc-instagram-2019-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMonica%20Geller's%20%26quot%3BFriends%26quot%3B%20apartment%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20much%20smaller.%20(I%20even%20live%20a%20few%20blocks%20away%20from%20the%20building%20that%20was%20used%20as%20the%20exterior%20shot%20for%20it%20on%20the%20show.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20has%20quirks%2C%20but%20that%20makes%20it%20feel%20very%20New%20York.%20It's%20also%20got%20history%20and%20character%2C%20as%20it%20hasn't%20been%20renovated%20or%20touched%20by%20modern%20architects%20in%20a%20long%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20may%20always%20complain%20about%20the%20noise%20from%20the%20restaurants%20below%20or%20about%20having%20to%20constantly%20get%20rid%20of%20things%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-decluttering-routine-small-home-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edeclutter%20my%20tiny%20space%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20I%20love%20my%20home%20and%20my%20neighbors.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20friends%20with%20the%20owner%20of%20the%20deli%20across%20the%20street%2C%20who%20used%20to%20hand%20me%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-breakfast-sandwich-gordon-ramsay-ina-garten-martha-stewart-recipes%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebreakfast%20sandwich%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20an%20orange%20juice%20every%20morning%20before%20school.%20(Later%2C%20I%20learned%20my%20dad%20had%20set%20up%20a%20weekly%20payment%20system%20with%20him.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20family%20friend%20runs%20a%20liquor%20store%20nearby%2C%20and%20the%20restaurant%20under%20me%20used%20to%20be%20owned%20by%20my%20father.%20The%20new%20owner%20always%20invites%20me%20to%20have%20dinner%20for%20free.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20have%20security%2C%20I%20have%20community%2C%20and%20I%20have%20memories%20here.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20apartment%20is%20far%20from%20perfect%2C%20but%20that's%20what%20makes%20it%20home.%20I%20wouldn't%20trade%20my%20home%20for%20anything%20%E2%80%A6%20even%20if%20I%20%3Cem%3Ewas%3C%2Fem%3E%20offered%20a%20bigger%20place%20with%20a%20sink%20in%20the%20bathroom.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frent-stabilized-apartment-new-york-city-cant-leave-benefits-drawbacks-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785687181000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4bd8a2965805a2c542d36e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frent-stabilized-apartment-new-york-city-cant-leave-benefits-drawbacks-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22My%20rent-stabilized%20apartment%20in%20New%20York%20City's%20West%20Village%20has%20drawbacks%2C%20but%20they%20don't%20outweigh%20the%20good%20deal%20it%20is%20to%20live%20here.%20I%20can't%20leave.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Isis%20O'Flynn-Shahaf)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Hungary%20shut%20its%20only%20nuclear%20plant%20for%20th