5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20Auto%20Train%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20%241%2C586.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20ride%20took%20just%20over%2017%20hours%2C%20the%20food%20was%20better%20than%20I%20expected%2C%20and%20I%20loved%20avoiding%20traffic.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAlthough%20our%20bathroom%20was%20small%20and%20sleeping%20on%20a%20train%20was%20challenging%2C%20I'd%20totally%20do%20this%20again.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20a%20recent%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-places-to-visit-florida-local-suggestions-things-to-do%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etrip%20to%20Florida%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20was%20excited%20to%20try%20out%20Amtrak's%20Auto%20Train.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-versus-flying-train-plane-holiday-travel-less-stressful-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Echoosing%20rail%20travel%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20paying%20a%20fee%20to%20bring%20my%20car%20on%20board%2C%20I'd%20be%20able%20to%20have%20my%20vehicle%20with%20me%20at%20my%20final%20destination%20%E2%80%94%20a%20benefit%20of%20driving%20without%20the%20stress%20of%20hitting%20the%20road.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20friend%20traveled%20with%20me%2C%20and%20we%20chose%20to%20bring%20one%20car%20and%20book%20a%20private%20bedroom%20for%20two.%20Our%20ride%20wasn't%20cheap%20at%20%241%2C586%20one-way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20when%20we%20looked%20at%20an%20alternative%20%E2%80%94%20flying%20down%20and%20renting%20a%20car%20for%20over%20a%20month%20once%20we%20landed%20%E2%80%94%20it%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20the%20cheaper%20option.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20only%20other%20option%20would%20be%20to%20drive%20the%20whole%20way.%20To%20me%2C%20the%20idea%20of%20spending%20a%20full%2024%20hours%20sitting%20in%20traffic%20on%20I-95%20only%20made%20this%20train%20trip%20way%20more%20appealing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I%20was%20skeptical%20about%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-auto-train-brought-car-worth-it-moving-review-2023-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20Auto%20Train%20ride%20%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%94%20and%20it%20did%20have%20highs%20and%20lows%20%E2%80%94%20it%20ultimately%20felt%20like%20a%20good%20value.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20how%20it%20went.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ELuckily%2C%20the%20journey%20is%20nonstop.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%20on%20tracks%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c2154f98752617776ca%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-booming-why-more-americans-taking-trains-record-ridership-revenue-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak's%20passenger-only%20trains%3C%2Fa%3E%20typically%20make%20multiple%20stops%2C%20which%20can%20result%20in%20longer%20rides%20as%20people%20get%20on%20and%20off.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20Amtrak%20currently%20has%20only%20one%20Auto%20Train%20route%20in%20the%20US%2C%20which%20operates%20nonstop%20between%20Lorton%2C%20Virginia%20(near%20Washington%2C%20DC)%20and%20Sanford%2C%20Florida%20(outside%20Orlando).%20The%20ride%20is%20just%20over%2017%20hours.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20limited%20stops%20meant%20this%20trip%20still%20required%20a%20few%20hours%20of%20driving%20for%20me%2C%20since%20I%20was%20traveling%20from%20farther%20north%20and%20heading%20farther%20south%20to%20the%20Keys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20so%2C%20I%20found%20it%20wonderful%20to%20spend%20most%20of%20my%20trip%20relaxing%20on%20the%20train%20and%20waking%20up%20close%20to%20our%20destination.%20Plus%2C%20I%20had%20the%20added%20comfort%20of%20knowing%20I%20wouldn't%20miss%20my%20stop.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EEach%20private%20room%20had%20its%20own%20attendant%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Private%20room%20with%20two%20seats%2C%20small%20sink%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c87548c9c486b30e3cc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe'd%20booked%20a%20private%20bedroom%2C%20which%20is%20a%20step%20up%20from%20a%20roomette%20and%20about%20double%20the%20size.%20According%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amtrak.com%2Fonboard%2Fonboard-accommodations-for-all-your-needs%2Fsleeper-car-accommodations%2Fbedrooms%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20website%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20these%20rooms%20are%20typically%20about%207.1%20to%207.5%20feet%20long%20and%206.6%20to%206.8%20feet%20wide.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20includes%20a%20single%20chair%20and%20a%20sofa%20(basically%20two%20wider%20chairs%20side%20by%20side)%20that%20transform%20into%20one%20of%20the%20two%20beds%20at%20night%2C%20plus%20a%20private%20bathroom.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20room%20came%20with%20a%20personal%20attendant%20who%20helped%20us%20settle%20into%20our%20small%20space%20and%20brought%20us%20water%20upon%20arrival.%20We%20didn't%20need%20much%20during%20the%20ride%2C%20but%20they%20were%20available%20to%20us%20if%20we%20did.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20this%20was%20my%20first%20trip%2C%20I%20was%20a%20little%20confused%20about%20how%20we%20would%20pull%20down%20the%20beds%2C%20so%20I%20was%20relieved%20to%20learn%20that%20everything%20would%20be%20taken%20care%20of%20for%20us.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20we%20were%20in%20the%20dining%20car%2C%20our%20attendant%20transformed%20the%20seats%20into%20bunk%20beds.%20The%20next%20morning%2C%20while%20we%20were%20eating%20breakfast%2C%20he%20came%20in%20and%20rearranged%20the%20beds%20back%20into%20seating%2C%20giving%20us%20more%20room%20to%20move%20around%20and%20pack%20up.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIt%20was%20nice%20not%20to%20worry%20about%20overpacking.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bed%20lowered%20from%20ceiling%20with%20made%20bed%20below%20in%20private%20room%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c26ce52cb26b83918fd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20Auto%20Train%2C%20vehicles%20are%20restricted%20by%20size%2C%20not%20weight.%20This%20is%20great%20news%20for%20someone%20whose%20bag%20is%20always%20over%20the%20weight%20limit%20when%20I%20fly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20able%20to%20pack%20my%20car%20with%20everything%20I%20needed%2C%20basically%20using%20it%20like%20a%20suitcase.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I%20was%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-things-packed-long-train-ride-wish-i-brought-amtrak%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eable%20to%20bring%20the%20essentials%3C%2Fa%3E%20I'd%20need%20for%20the%20night%20on%20board%20with%20me%2C%20I%20learned%20that%20less%20is%20more.%20Since%20space%20in%20each%20room%20is%20limited%2C%20it's%20best%20to%20bring%20only%20what%20you%20really%20need%20for%20the%20night.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20was%20especially%20important%20when%20the%20beds%20in%20the%20room%20were%20down%2C%20as%20it%20took%20away%20most%20of%20the%20floor%20space%20and%20made%20getting%20ready%20a%20bit%20of%20a%20challenge.%20It%20would've%20been%20even%20tougher%20if%20we'd%20been%20tripping%20over%20suitcases%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20food%20was%20better%20than%20I%20expected.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Croissant%2C%20quiche%2C%20poatoes%20on%20plate%20for%20breakfast%20on%20Amtrak%20plate%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c87ce52cb26b8391904%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20this%20train%2C%20passengers%20in%20private%20rooms%20received%20complimentary%20meals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'll%20admit%20I%20had%20quite%20low%20expectations%20for%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-dining-car-surprising-things-from-frequent-traveler-2022-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efood%20on%20a%20train%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20I%20was%20pleasantly%20surprised.%20Our%20dinner%20menu%20consisted%20of%20four%20options%3A%20steak%2C%20chicken%2C%20salmon%2C%20or%20pasta.%20Each%20entr%C3%A9e%20came%20with%20a%20salad%20and%20a%20dessert.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20the%20dining%20car%20was%20no%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsurprising-things-first-time-michelin-star-restaurant-eleven-madison-park-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMichelin-star%20restaurant%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20we%20found%20both%20the%20steak%20and%20the%20chicken%20to%20be%20pretty%20enjoyable.%20Also%2C%20to%20our%20surprise%2C%20we%20were%20each%20even%20served%20a%20complimentary%20glass%20of%20wine%20with%20dinner.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20breakfast%2C%20we%20were%20served%20coffee%2C%20tea%2C%20and%20juice%20alongside%20our%20meals.%20I%20had%20a%20spinach-artichoke%20quiche%20that%20was%20pretty%20good%2C%20though%20I%20wish%20the%20potatoes%20it%20was%20served%20with%20had%20been%20warmer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20vibes%20of%20the%20dining%20car%20were%20pretty%20nice%2C%20too.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224266%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dimly%20lit%20dining%20car%20with%20white%20table%20cloth%20on%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8f4b54f98752617776f4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223199%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20not%20as%20elegant%20as%20what%20I%20have%20seen%20depicted%20during%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhistoric-train-travel-photos-2022-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGolden%20Age%20of%20Rail%20Travel%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%201800s%2C%20the%20whole%20dining%20experience%20made%20me%20feel%20like%20I%20was%20in%20a%20black-and-white%20movie.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20dinner%2C%20tables%20in%20the%20dining%20car%20were%20covered%20in%20white%20tablecloths%2C%20set%20with%20rolled%20silverware%2C%20and%20adorned%20with%20vases%20of%20flowers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20breakfast%2C%20the%20car%20was%20a%20bit%20simpler%20but%20still%20nice%2C%20with%20a%20banana%20placed%20at%20each%20seat%20and%20crumb%20cakes%20waiting%20on%20the%20table.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EEveryone%20we%20encountered%20on%20the%20train%20was%20friendly.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Hand%20holding%20glass%20of%20liquid%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c26ce52cb26b83918fc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20space%20is%20limited%2C%20there%20are%20no%20private%20tables%20in%20the%20dining%20car.%20Passengers%20are%20seated%20with%20other%20parties%20to%20fill%20up%20the%20booths.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20age%20range%20of%20passengers%20varied%20from%20families%20with%20very%20young%20children%20playing%20peek-a-boo%20between%20courses%20to%20seniors%20toasting%20to%20another%20successful%20trip%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmillionaire-at-25-not-happy-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eyoung%20professionals%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20their%2020s%20and%2030s.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20waiting%20for%20their%20meals%2C%20everyone%20around%20us%20seemed%20to%20be%20discussing%20their%20travel%20plans%20with%20their%20tablemates.%20I%20found%20out%20that%20many%20passengers%20were%20regulars%20on%20the%20Auto%20Train%20who%20preferred%20it%20over%20other%20modes%20of%20transportation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELaughter%20could%20be%20heard%20from%20nearly%20every%20table%2C%20and%20many%20groups%20of%20new%20friends%20were%20lingering%20so%20long%20after%20dessert%20that%20the%20waiters%20had%20to%20announce%20they%20could%20continue%20their%20conversation%20in%20another%20car%2C%20as%20they%20had%20to%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20next%20seating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOn%20the%20flip%20side%2C%20our%20bathroom%20was%20even%20tinier%20than%20I%20thought%20it'd%20be.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225472%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22View%20of%20toilet%20in%20bathroom%20area%20in%20private%20room%20on%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c20548c9c486b30e3bb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223648%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wasn't%20expecting%20a%20large%20bathroom%20in%20our%20tiny%20space%2C%20but%20it%20was%20even%20smaller%20than%20I%20thought%20it%20would%20be.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIts%20simple%20layout%20consisted%20of%20only%20a%20toilet%20with%20a%20showerhead%20above%20it.%20The%20toilet%20paper%20needed%20to%20be%20hidden%20behind%20a%20plastic%20flap%20to%20protect%20it%20from%20getting%20wet%20when%20the%20shower%20was%20turned%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToiletries%2C%20like%20body%20wash%2C%20were%20mounted%20on%20the%20wall%2C%20and%20two%20towels%20were%20stored%20at%20the%20top%20of%20the%20restroom%20area%2C%20way%20above%20the%20toilet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20had%20a%20sink%2C%20too%2C%20but%20it%20was%20located%20outside%20the%20bathroom.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EShowering%20was%20also%20a%20bit%20tricky.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Shower%20area%20with%20towels%20on%20high%20rack%20in%20private%20room%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c2454f98752617776cb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20found%20there%20to%20be%20very%20little%20room%20to%20stand%20up%20and%20shower%2C%20as%20the%20toilet%20took%20up%20the%20majority%20of%20the%20space.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20saw%20a%20sign%20inside%20the%20bathroom%20recommending%20passengers%20sit%20to%20shower%2C%20to%20make%20the%20experience%20more%20comfortable.%20I%20can't%20say%20whether%20that's%20true%2C%20though%2C%20as%20I%20wasn't%20ready%20to%20try%20for%20myself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIt%20was%20nice%20to%20have%20a%20bed%2C%20but%20sleeping%20on%20a%20train%20was%20pretty%20challenging.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225472%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22View%20of%20%26quot%3BBunk%26quot%3B%20beds%20in%20private%20room%20on%20%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8c20548c9c486b30e3bd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223648%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20two%20beds%20in%20our%20room%20seemed%20designed%20to%20make%20the%20most%20of%20the%20space.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20upper%20bed%20was%20slightly%20smaller%20and%20had%20an%20attached%20safety%20net%20of%20sorts%20to%20keep%20people%20from%20rolling%20out%20of%20it.%20This%20made%20me%20uncomfortable%20as%20I%20wasn't%20able%20to%20sit%20up.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20bottom%20bunk%2C%20however%2C%20was%20more%20spacious%20with%20room%20overhead%2C%20and%20it%20was%20much%20more%20pleasant%20to%20rest%20in.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnfortunately%2C%20although%20I%20did%20get%20some%20sleep%2C%20I%20found%20myself%20tossing%20and%20turning%20all%20night%20long.%20My%20night%20wasn't%20altogether%20unpleasant%3B%20I%20just%20couldn't%20seem%20to%20get%20more%20than%20an%20hour's%20worth%20of%20sleep%20at%20a%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20find%20that%20the%20gentle%20rocking%20of%20the%20train%20puts%20them%20right%20to%20sleep%2C%20but%20I%20am%20not%20one%20of%20those%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EUltimately%2C%20the%20benefits%20of%20this%20ride%20outweigh%20any%20drawbacks%20for%20me.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224457%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22View%20outside%20window%20of%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e8cdb548c9c486b30e3d6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223343%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Silver%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I%20didn't%20get%20much%20sleep%20on%20board%2C%20our%20overall%20experience%20in%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-private-bedroom-review-photos%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eprivate%20bedroom%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20the%20Auto%20Train%20was%20actually%20better%20than%20expected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20ride%20felt%20like%20solid%20value%2C%20especially%20since%20I%20was%20taking%20a%20longer%20trip%20and%20could%20avoid%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpros-cons-turo-use-for-renting-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecost%20of%20renting%20a%20car%3C%2Fa%3E%20once%20we%20got%20to%20Florida%2C%20where%20I%20was%20staying%20for%20over%20a%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20trip%20itself%20was%20just%20over%2017%20hours%2C%20but%20instead%20of%20sitting%20in%20traffic%20on%20the%20highway%2C%20we%20could%20spend%20time%20playing%20games%2C%20enjoying%20meals%2C%20watching%20downloaded%20movies%20on%20our%20laptops%2C%20and%20even%20getting%20some%20work%20done.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnlike%20a%20road%20trip%2C%20we%20also%20didn't%20have%20to%20stop%20to%20grab%20food%2C%20rest%20at%20a%20hotel%2C%20or%20use%20restrooms%2C%20which%20made%20this%20ride%20feel%20extra%20efficient.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20someone%20who%20tends%20to%20take%20longer%20trips%20and%20often%20needs%20a%20car%20at%20their%20destination%2C%20I%20would%20definitely%20take%20the%20Auto%20Train%20again.%20I'd%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-upgrade-coach-to-private-room-roomette-worth-it-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eupgrade%20to%20a%20private%20room%3C%2Fa%3E%20again%2C%20too%2C%20since%20I%20appreciated%20having%20a%20bed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you're%20traveling%20for%20only%20a%20week%2C%20though%2C%20you'll%20want%20to%20crunch%20the%20numbers.%20The%20cost%20of%20the%20Auto%20Train%20(and%20bringing%20your%20car%20on%20it)%20might%20not%20be%20worth%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EBusiness%20Insider%20reached%20out%20to%20Amtrak%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-auto-train-private-bedroom-review-photos-pros-cons-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785685081000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5e911454f987526177770a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-auto-train-private-bedroom-review-photos-pros-cons-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22We%20brought%20our%20car%20on%20the%20Amtrak%20Auto%20Train%20and%20booked%20a%20private%20bedroom%20for%20the%20trip%20from%20Virginia%20to%20Florida.%20Here's%20how%20the%20ride%20(and%20meals)%20were.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Jay%20Silver)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22'Cruel%20terrorist%20act'%3A%20Moscow%20mayor%20on%20restaurant%20blast%20that%20killed%203%2C%20injured%2021%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785684993000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132809305%2Cimgsize-124696.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Fcruel-terrorist-act-moscow-mayor-on-restaurant-blast-that-killed-3-injured