ue%20and%20two%20wireless%2C%20column-shaped%20side%20speakers%20that%20can%20be%20placed%20on%20either%20side%20of%20your%20screen.%20This%20enables%20a%20wider%20left-to-right%20soundstage%20than%20most%20traditional%20soundbars%2C%20which%20can't%20stretch%20to%20the%20sides%20of%20a%20massive%20screen.%20The%20side%20speakers%20also%20have%20upfiring%20drivers%20to%20provide%20height%20effects%20for%203D%20audio%20formats%20like%20Dolby%20Atmos%20and%20DTS%3AX%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D8c3dff1672d213e1c6af23a589e8926b67a9c6fb04f81fff6361c54277aeb7ab%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSony-BRAVIA-Theater-3-Unit-Soundbar%252Fdp%252FB0GSBXP3XB%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBravia%20Theater%20Trio%3C%2Fa%3E%20delivers%20great%20performance%20for%20a%20one-box%20setup%2C%20with%20clear%20detail%2C%20immersive%20sound%2C%20and%20simplified%20control.%20But%20at%20%242%2C200%2C%20it's%20also%20incredibly%20expensive%20for%20a%20system%20without%20a%20subwoofer%20or%20rear%20surround%20speakers.%20Sony%20lets%20you%20add%20them%2C%20including%20up%20to%20two%20subwoofers%2C%20but%20that%20pushes%20the%20cost%20to%20nearly%20%244%2C000%20or%20%245%2C000.%20That's%20more%20than%20enough%20for%20a%20quality%20wired%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-surround-sound-systems%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esurround%20sound%20system%3C%2Fa%3E.%20You%20can%20also%20get%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-soundbars%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etop-tier%20soundbar%20setup%3C%2Fa%3E%20like%20the%20fantastic%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fsonos-arc-ultra-soundbar-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESonos%20Arc%20Ultra%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20a%20sub%20and%20Era%20300%20surrounds%20for%20less.%20While%20the%20Trio%20is%20an%20intriguing%20and%20capable%20new%20option%20for%20people%20with%20big-screen%20TVs%2C%20from%20a%20value%20standpoint%2C%20it's%20a%20tough%20ask.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22da0f08ff-af34-41ca-b53b-591441a9c1d5%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Design%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20Trio%20offers%20a%20minimalist%20and%20professional%20aesthetic%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20home%20entertainment%20setup%20with%20a%20large%20TV%2C%20Sony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%20speaker%20system%2C%20audio%20components%2C%20and%20media%20console%20shelves.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6bb01787737bff3ebd9860%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20system%20includes%20two%20side%20speakers%20and%20a%20center%20bar.%3Cp%3ERyan%20Waniata%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trio's%20design%20is%20unlike%20any%20competing%20soundbar%20system%20I've%20tested.%20Where%20Sony's%20similarly%20unique%20Quad%20speakers%20aim%20to%20virtually%20disappear%20in%20your%20room%2C%20the%20Trio's%20tubular%20side%20speakers%20make%20a%20statement%2C%20looking%20like%20futuristic%20towers%20on%20speaker%20stands%20or%20a%20pro%20cinema%20system%20when%20wall-mounted.%20The%20center%20bar%20is%20adorably%20small%2C%20with%20a%20uniform%20plastic%20cabinet%20wrapped%20in%20soft%20acoustic%20fabric%2C%20and%20only%20two%20LEDs%20out%20front%20as%20a%20visual%20display.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%203.0.2-channel%20setup%20comprises%20nine%20individually%20powered%20drivers%2C%20starting%20with%20dual%20rectangular%20drivers%20flanking%20a%20single%20tweeter%20in%20the%20center%20speaker.%20Each%20side%20speaker%20hosts%20a%20traditional%20woofer-and-tweeter%20combo%20out%20front%2C%20and%20a%20topside%20driver%20to%20bounce%20sound%20off%20your%20ceiling%20for%20the%20height%20effects%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fwhat-is-dolby-atmos%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDolby%20Atmos%20and%20DTS%3AX%20sound%20mixes%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20build%20quality%20feels%20stout%20enough%2C%20though%20Sony's%20liberal%20use%20of%20plastic%20leans%20more%20toward%20cheaper%20soundbars%20than%20traditional%20speaker%20cabinets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENewer%20Bravia%20Theater%20models%20have%20been%20light%20on%20inputs%2C%20and%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D8c3dff1672d213e1c6af23a589e8926b67a9c6fb04f81fff6361c54277aeb7ab%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSony-BRAVIA-Theater-3-Unit-Soundbar%252Fdp%252FB0GSBXP3XB%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBravia%20Trio%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20no%20exception.%20At%20the%20back%20of%20the%20center%20speaker%20are%20just%20two%20inputs%3A%20an%20HDMI%20eARC%2FARC%20port%20for%20connecting%20to%20your%20TV%20and%20a%20spare%20HDMI%20input%20for%20a%20Blu-ray%20player%20or%20game%20console.%20You'll%20find%20no%20digital%20or%20analog%20inputs%20for%20connecting%20other%20audio%20gear%2C%20or%20even%20an%20Ethernet%20port%20for%20your%20network.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20close-up%20of%20the%20Sony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%20center%20speaker%20in%20our%20reviewer's%20media%20console.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6bb38797a2276a3423b6ae%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20center%20speaker%20is%20like%20a%20mini%20soundbar%20unit.%3Cp%3ERyan%20Waniata%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EInput%20envy%20is%20becoming%20the%20norm%20for%