igure%3E%3Cp%3EJust%20as%20impressive%20is%20how%20well%20the%20system%20expands%20traditional%20surround%20formats%20with%20Sony's%20Sound%20Field%20mode%2C%20making%20them%20sound%20more%20like%20spatial%20audio.%20Christopher%20Nolan's%20%26quot%3BDark%20Knight%26quot%3B%20had%20me%20hooked%20from%20the%20crisp%20pop%20of%20glass%20at%20the%20intro%20as%20the%20hooligans%20descend%20on%20the%20bank.%20The%20speakers%20did%20well%20with%20the%20soundtrack's%20ambient%20urgency%2C%20and%20various%20effects%2C%20like%20machine-gun%20clatter%20inside%20a%20bank%2C%20seemed%20to%20pop%20up%20over%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Flg-mrgb95b-micro-rgb-tv-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E75-inch%20LG%20Micro%20RGB%3C%2Fa%3E%20I%20used%20for%20testing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20favorite%20experience%20was%20replaying%20%26quot%3BRed%20Dead%20Redemption%20II%2C%26quot%3B%20which%2C%20even%20with%20just%20a%207.1%20soundtrack%2C%20sounds%20starkly%20realistic%2C%20largely%20thanks%20to%20the%20Trio's%20seamless%20transition%20between%20the%20bar%20and%20side%20speakers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20throughout%20my%20testing%2C%20the%20sound%20was%20mostly%20stuck%20at%20the%20front%20of%20the%20room%2C%20with%20a%20few%20exceptions%20like%20a%20virtual%20bullet%20sweeping%20past%20my%20cheek%20or%20a%20rushing%20creek%20flowing%20out%20of%20the%20wall.%20Part%20of%20that%20is%20because%2C%20unlike%20some%20flagship%20soundbars%2C%20the%20Trio's%20center%20speaker%20lacks%20dedicated%20side-firing%20drivers%20to%20bounce%20sound%20off%20your%20wall%2C%20so%20effects%20like%20a%20bird%20swirling%20behind%20you%20fail%20to%20complete%20their%20cycle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20with%20side-firing%20drivers%2C%20though%2C%20it's%20rare%20for%20effects%20to%20get%20fully%20behind%20you%20without%20actual%20rear%20speakers.%20While%20the%20Trio%20is%20a%20solid%20start%2C%20to%20really%20feel%20the%20%26quot%3Bdome%26quot%3B%20of%20the%20best%20Dolby%20Atmos%20or%20DTS%3AX%20films%20and%20TV%20shows%2C%20you'll%20need%20to%20add%20physical%20rear%20speakers%20like%20the%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Df08d1deceb8c2d8db7e76f7de232ff8b6cfb86fd53ce621277ec82c700d6c38e%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSony-Wireless-Speakers-HT-A7000-STR-AN1000%252Fdp%252FB0DYWWX3LW%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBravia%20Rear%208%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20(preferably)%20the%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D5f40c0d424b37fcb910065f291d2b6afc49023ecac1f02ef105f1a4463e90714%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSony-Theater-Wireless-Speakers-Soundbar%252Fdp%252FB0GSCCJNGY%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ERear%209%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20have%20their%20own%20upfiring%20drivers%20to%20match%20the%20Trio's%20front%20speakers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESimilarly%2C%20while%20mid-bass%20is%20hearty%20for%20speakers%20this%20size%20(sometimes%20buzzing%20my%20floor)%2C%20they%20don't%20hit%20as%20hard%20as%20larger%20speakers%2C%20let%20alone%20dedicated%20subwoofers.%20Without%20those%20elements%2C%20the%20Trio's%20performance%20sometimes%20feels%20like%20an%20unfinished%20sentence.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bcec9e4c-fcea-4529-937f-19cbdb7f34f5%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Music%20playback%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EMusic%20sounds%20clear%20and%20balanced%2C%20but%20stick%20to%20stereo%20playback%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20close-up%20of%20one%20of%20the%20Sony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%20side%20speakers%20in%20our%20reviewer's%20living%20room.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6bb18da62e6e00bc538aa5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222250%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Trio%20can%20create%20virtualized%203D%20audio%2C%20but%20music%20sounds%20best%20in%20basic%20stereo%20mode.%3Cp%3ERyan%20Waniata%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trio%20delivers%20excellent%20balance%20between%20its%20side%20and%20center%20speakers%20while%20streaming%20music%20via%20Spotify%20Connect%20and%20AirPlay.%20Vocals%20are%20crisp%20and%20present%2C%20instruments%20bloom%20with%20textural%20detail%2C%20and%20the%20wider%20soundstage%20makes%20for%20a%20pleasant%20presentation%20of%20complex%20tracks%2C%20from%20the%20Beach%20Boys%20surf%20ballads%20to%20Radiohead's%20%26quot%3BEverything%20In%20Its%20Right%20Place.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20one%20exception%20was%20listening%20with%20the%20Sound%20Field%20mode%20on%2C%20which%20jumped%20out%20right%20away.%20This%20setting%20is%20supposed%20to%20provide%20a%20more%20open%20and%20engulfing%20soundstage%2C%20but%20instead%2C%20it%20amplifies%20the%20Trio's%20worst%20tendencies.%20Instruments%20sound%20overly%20synthetic%2C%20and%20dense%20mixes%20feel%20oddly%20hollow%20compared%20to%20regular%20stereo%20playback.%20While%20Sony's%20Sound%20Mapping%20feature%20has%20impressive%203D%20virtualization%20for%20movies%20and%20TV%20shows%2C%20stereo%20music%20sounds%20much%20better%20in%20its%20natural%20format.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b16e828e-1390-46a9-b0ec-9cc6a8e8890f%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22App%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20app%20is%20your%20lifeline%2C%20for%20better%20and%20for%20worse%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221757%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Our%20reviewer's%20hand%20holds%20a%20smartphone%20controlling%20a%20Bravia%20Theatre%20Trio%20sound%20system%20in%20front%20of%20a%20television%20and%20speakers.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6ba216a62e6e00bc53897f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221318%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIt's%20simple%20to%20set%20up%20the%20system%20with%20the%20Bravia%20Connect%20app%2C%20and%20the%20included%20microphone%20attachment%20optimizes%20the%20speakers'%20sound%20for%20your%20room.%3Cp%3ERyan%20Waniata%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trio's%20incredibly%20simple%20setup%20and%20control%20are%20largely%20thanks%20to%20the%20Bravia%20Connect%20app.%20The%20app%20makes%20it%20easy%20to%20connect%2C%20control%20playback%2C%20switch%20inputs%2C%20and%20check%20your%20current%20audio%20format%20and%20resolution%2C%20among%20other%20features.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20great%20when%20it%20works%2C%20but%20during%20the%20first%20few%20days%20of%20testing%2C%20I%20had%20issues%20connecting%20to%20the%20app%20and%20streaming%20via%20Spotify%20Connect%2C%20resulting%20in%20multiple%20stallouts.%20After%20re-pairing%20the%20app%20and%20going%20through%20the%20setup%20process%20again%2C%20the%20system%20has%20now%20been%20stable%20for%20multiple%20days.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20test%20tons%20of%20WiFi%20speakers%20and%20TVs%2C%20and%20while%20the%20vast%20majority%20of%20them%20work%20without%20issue%2C%20my%20network%20can%20be%20finicky%20with%20some%20products.%20That's%20actually%20why%20I%20haven't%20changed%20it%20%E2%80%94%20consider%20me%20a%20quirky%20network%20testing%20ground.%20I'd%20expect%20smooth%20sailing%20for%20most%20folks%2C%20but%20since%20the%20Trio%20doesn't%20offer%20an%20Ethernet%20backup%2C%20WiFi%20stability%20is%20very%20important.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20app%20can%20also%20be%20simple%20to%20a%20fault%2C%20with%20no%20options%20for%20basic%20EQ%20adjustments%2C%20only%20three%20bass%20modes%2C%20and%20no%20way%20to%20adjust%20individual%20channel%20levels.%20Sony's%20calibration%2Foptimization%20system%20is%20effective%20enough%20that%20I%20rarely%20felt%20the%20need%20to%20adjust%20settings%2C%20but%20those%20are%20options%20I'd%20expect%20at%20this%20price%20and%20scale.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222610e4ab-152a-4b49-91fb-5d722204ac2b%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Should%20you%20buy%20it%3F%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EShould%20you%20buy%20the%20Sony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222702%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20LG%20TV%20displaying%20a%20white%20bear%20swimming%20underwater%20is%20set%20up%20in%20our%20reviewer's%20living%20room%20along%20with%20a%20Sony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%20sound%20system.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6bb14fa62e6e00bc538aa2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222026%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%20is%20an%20interesting%20audio%20solution%20for%20big-screen%20TVs%2C%20but%20it's%20pricey%20for%20what%20you%20get.%3Cp%3ERyan%20Waniata%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D8c3dff1672d213e1c6af23a589e8926b67a9c6fb04f81fff6361c54277aeb7ab%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSony-BRAVIA-Theater-3-Unit-Soundbar%252Fdp%252FB0GSBXP3XB%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESony%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20a%20powerful%203.0.2-channel%20system%20that's%20bound%20to%20be%20divisive%20on%20cost%20alone.%20It%20offers%20very%20good%20performance%20for%20a%20three-speaker%20system%2C%20and%20its%20mix%20of%20minimalism%2C%20simplicity%2C%20and%20modular%20configuration%20gives%20it%20room%20to%20grow%20with%20the%20size%20of%20your%20room%20and%20screen.%20While%20I%20wasn't%20able%20to%20test%20it%20with%20Sony's%20surround%20speakers%20and%20subwoofers%2C%20I've%20demoed%20the%20flagship%20Rear%209%20and%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D42c5835d524123fab7e02fafdbaa25f43ea9fc76e240b69151dfae7145929afb%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252Fdp%252FB0GSC3F2Q8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETheater%20Sub%209%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20I'm%20confident%20the%20full%20setup%20will%20rival%20similar%20multi-speaker%20soundbar%20options%20from%20any%20major%20competitor.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20value%20is%20definitely%20a%20sticking%20point%20here.%20For%20example%2C%20you%20can%20find%20the%20older%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D21a63a9302ae6b4df884cad5290d1ae5210c323a4d2c5980d12cb8cb4265859c%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252Fdp%252FB0CTKV9DRP%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESamsung%2011.1.4-channel%20Q990D%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20one%20of%20the%20best%20one-box%20sound%20systems%20you%20can%20buy%2C%20for%20half%20the%20price%20of%20the%20Bravia%20Theater%20Trio.%20And%20that%20system%20includes%20rear%20speakers%20and%20a%20subwoofer.%20Alternatively%2C%20buying%20a%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D896db0ace055eaa7c079b895090635b4f9c8a214d201c4261ea7e0cedcf8ea3e%26postID%3D6a6b74d49f23b1ffde7d3570%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Ftech%252Fsony-bravia-theater-trio-speaker-system-review%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FSonos-Ultra-Soundbar-Dolby-Control%252Fdp%252FB0DFK28LBB%253Fth%253D1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESonos%20Arc%20Ultra%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20two%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh