ly-two-months-without-sufficient-rain-are-shrinking-grapes-and-accelerating-the-2026-harvest%2Farticleshow%2F132806595.cms%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia-indiatimes-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Fbordeaux-vineyards-escaped-the-immediate-wildfires-but-repeated-heatwaves-and-nearly-two-months-without-sufficient-rain-are-shrinking-grapes-and-accelerating-the-2026-harvest%2Famp_articleshow%2F132806595.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Frest-of-world%2Fbordeaux-vineyards-escaped-the-immediate-wildfires-but-repeated-heatwaves-and-nearly-two-months-without-sufficient-rain-are-shrinking-grapes-and-accelerating-the-2026-harvest%2Famp_articleshow%2F132806595.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20built%20my%20tiny%20home%20from%20scratch%20for%20under%20%2450%2C000.%20Doing%20it%20all%20myself%20was%20hard%2C%20but%20the%20money%20I'm%20saving%20is%20worth%20it.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221206%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Person%20sits%20smiling%20on%20front%20steps%20of%20a%20small%20white%20house%20with%20black%20trim%2C%20planters%2C%20and%20wreath.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a690519ce52cb26b8394df0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22777%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMargo%20Fairchild%20in%20front%20of%20her%20Virginia%20tiny%20home.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Margo%20Fairchild%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EIn%202020%2C%20Margo%20Fairchild%20built%20a%20tiny%20home%20on%20her%20own%20with%20no%20prior%20experience.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFairchild%20spent%20countless%20hours%20and%20almost%20all%20her%20paychecks%20to%20build%20the%20240-square-foot%20home.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIt%20took%2015%20months%20and%20%2443%2C779%20to%20build%20the%20home%2C%20but%20the%20freedom%20she%20has%20is%20priceless%2C%20she%20said.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Margo%20Fairchild%2C%2034%2C%20who%20built%20a%20240-square-foot%20tiny%20home%20in%20Virginia%20on%20her%20own%20in%202020.%20The%20conversation%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20grew%20up%20watching%20my%20dad%20work%20with%20his%20hands%2C%20mostly%20on%20cars%2C%20and%20I%20picked%20up%20a%20bit%20of%20resourcefulness%20and%20that%20get-it-done%20attitude%20from%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20when%20I%20decided%20I%20wanted%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiny-living-taught-me-how-to-save-money-better-consumer-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elive%20in%20a%20tiny%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20it%20never%20really%20crossed%20my%20mind%20to%20have%20someone%20else%20build%20it%20for%20me.%20Maybe%20that%20was%20partly%20because%20of%20the%20expense%2C%20but%20after%20spending%20a%20few%20years%20researching%20and%20studying%20building%20science%2C%20I%20felt%20like%20I%20could%20take%20it%20on%20myself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20started%20construction%20in%202020%20and%20took%2015%20months%20to%20build%20my%20240-square-foot%20tiny%20home.%20It%20wasn't%20like%20an%20HGTV%20show%20where%20you%20see%20the%20finished%20reveal%2020%20minutes%20later.%20I%20was%20in%20the%20weeds%2C%20working%20on%20it%20every%20single%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20hardest%20part%20of%20the%20project%20was%20finding%20the%20grit%20to%20keep%20going%20while%20working%2014-%20to%2018-hour%20days%2C%20often%20after%20my%20regular%20job%20and%20on%20weekends.%20It%20was%20a%20huge%20mental%20burden.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20would%20ask%20myself%2C%20%26quot%3BCan%20I%20really%20do%20this%3F%26quot%3B%20and%20then%20just%20keep%20pushing%20forward.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229fcbf47f-6f00-46f6-8ef2-ca799a75b304%5C%22%3ENearly%20all%20of%20my%20time%20and%20money%20were%20spent%20on%20construction%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20mom%20has%20a%20small%20piece%20of%20land%20%E2%80%94%20less%20than%20an%20acre.%20We%20agreed%20that%20I%20could%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparents-built-tiny-home-for-me-on-property-rent-free-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebuild%20my%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20her%20property%20and%20move%20in%20with%20her%20while%20it%20was%20under%20construction.%20In%20exchange%2C%20I%20gave%20her%20a%20little%20money%20for%20rent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20used%20my%20savings%20to%20pay%20for%20the%20project.%20Basically%2C%20any%20paycheck%20I%20had%20during%20that%20time%20went%20toward%20construction.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlmost%20immediately%2C%20my%20budget%20flew%20out%20the%20window.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20side-by-side%20image%20of%20a%20woman%20working%20on%20a%20home%20renovation%2C%20drilling%20wooden%20framing%2C%20and%20installing%20a%20white%20ceiling%20panel%20from%20a%20ladder.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6908bbce52cb26b8394e11%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAside%20from%20the%20plumbing%2C%20Fairchild%20built%20the%20entire%20home%20herself.%3Cp%3ECourtest%20of%20Margo%20Fairchild%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20my%20biggest%20expenses%20was%20purchasing%20the%20shell%2C%20which%20forms%20the%20home's%20basic%20structure.%20It%20didn't%20come%20with%20a%20ceiling%2C%20skylight%2C%20insulation%2C%20or%20any%20additional%20structural%20framing%2C%20so%20I%20had%20to%20add%20all%20of%20that%20myself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20learned%20as%20I%20went%2C%20and%20there%20was%20a%20lot%20of%20trial%20and%20error.%20I%20often%20turned%20to%20%26quot%3BYouTube%20University.%26quot%3B%20I%20also%20started%20an%20Instagram%20page%2C%20and%20architects%20and%20builders%20from%20places%20as%20far%20away%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-cities-to-visit-netherlands-from-local-utrecht-leiden-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eas%20Holland%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20Portland%20would%20reach%20out%20and%20offer%20advice%20whenever%20I%20had%20a%20question.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20building%20during%20the%20pandemic%20and%20couldn't%20have%20people%20come%20out%20to%20help%2C%20so%20it%20was%20nice%20to%20feel%20like%20I%20had%20a%20community%20of%20people%20to%20bounce%20ideas%20off%20of.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221206%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Smiling%20person%20in%20glasses%20and%20safety%20harness%20stands%20on%20a%20shingled%20roof%20beside%20a%20newly%20installed%20skylight.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a690586548c9c486b311833%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EFairchild%20on%20the%20roof%20of%20the%20tiny%20home.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Margo%20Fairchild%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20only%20work%20I%20hired%20out%20during%20the%20project%20was%20the%20plumbing.%20I%20hired%20someone%20who%20wasn't%20very%20reputable%2C%20which%20was%20definitely%20a%20big%20mistake.%20They%20connected%20my%20system%20to%20my%20mom's%20house%2C%20which%20uses%20a%20septic%20tank%2C%20and%20the%20entire%20setup%20failed.%20Wastewater%20from%20both%20homes%20flooded%20my%20mom's%20crawlspace.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20had%20to%20pay%20another%20company%20to%20fix%20it%2C%20and%20in%20the%20end%2C%20I%20had%20to%20put%20about%20%247%2C000%20to%20%248%2C000%20on%20a%20credit%20card.%20But%20at%20that%20point%2C%20I%20didn't%20care.%20I%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fcredit-score%2Faverage-credit-score%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egood%20credit%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20knew%20I%20could%20use%20my%20credit%20card%20if%20needed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAltogether%2C%20I%20ended%20up%20spending%20%2443%2C779%20to%20build%20the%20home%20%E2%80%94%20nearly%20double%20what%20I%20had%20expected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a4afcc0e-4f7c-46f0-b5c1-c0dad485c78b%5C%22%3EMy%20home%20is%20small%2C%20but%20it%20meets%20all%20my%20needs%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20moved%20into%20my%20home%20in%202022%2C%20and%20I%20was%20so%20excited.%20I%20was%2029%20and%20single%20at%20the%20time%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flived-with-parents-adult-now-neighbors-benefits-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eliving%20with%20my%20mom%20%3C%2Fa%3Ewas%20just%20not%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20tiny%20home%20is%20basically%20a%20studio.%20It%20has%20one%20bedroom%20and%20one%20bathroom%20with%20a%20bathtub.%20My%20queen-size%20bed%20is%20lofted%20above%20the%20dining%20booth.%20It's%20really%20tiny.%20I%20recently%20got%20a%20dog%2C%20and%20she's%20under%20my%20feet%20all%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20it's%20incredibly%20freeing%20to%20turn%20up%20my%20music%2C%20open%20the%20door%2C%20and%20let%20my%20dog%20run%20around%20in%20the%20fenced-in%20yard.%20It's%20nice%20to%20wake%20up%2C%20look%20around%20and%20say%2C%20%26quot%3BHey%2C%20I%20did%20that.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Split%20view%20shows%20a%20loft%20bed%20over%20a%20dining%20nook%20and%20a%20Margo%20Fairchild%20cuddling%20a%20dog%20on%20a%20sofa.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6d32b487737bff3ebda3dd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EFairchild's%20bedroom%2C%20dining%20area%2C%20and%20her%20sitting%20with%20her%20dog.%3Cp%3ESage%20Roddy%2FTiny%20Home%20Tours%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20don't%20feel%20like%20I%20had%20to%20give%20up%20too%20much%20when%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdownsizing-move-more-family-time-less-money-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edownsized%20from%20a%20normal-sized%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20a%20tiny%20home.%20It%20was%20actually%20pretty%20therapeutic%20to%20start%20with%20a%20clean%20slate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20left%20some%20of%20my%20things%20with%20my%20former%20partner%20and%20rent%20a%20storage%20unit%20where%20I%20store%20the%20rest.%20I%20also%20keep%20my%20winter%20clothes%20in%20a%20closet%20at%20my%20mom's%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOf%20course%2C%20there%20are%20drawbacks%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiny-living-taught-me-how-to-save-money-better-consumer-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eliving%20in%20a%20tiny%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20like%20how%20quickly%20a%20small%20space%20gets%20cluttered.%20You%20definitely%20have%20to%20keep%20it%20tidy%20so%20you%20don't%20trip%20over%20something%20and%20break%20your%20neck.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20would%20say%20the%20biggest%20drawback%2C%20though%2C%20is%20giving%20up%20the%20extra%20space%20for%20an%20office%20or%20just%20somewhere%20to%20tinker%20inside%20my%20home.%20But%20other%20than%20those%20things%2C%20I%20think%20my%20tiny%20home%20meets%20my%20needs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fa2f5f6b-f3fb-4e24-9b66-794044867ecf%5C%22%3EMy%20tiny%20home%20is%20helping%20me%20save%20for%20retirement%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20pay%20my%20mom%20%24500%20a%20month%20to%20live%20on%20her%20property.%20Compared%20with%20the%20%242%2C000%20to%20%243%2C000%20I%20might%20pay%20elsewhere%2C%20the%20savings%20have%20allowed%20me%20to%20put%20more%20money%20toward%20retirement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20home%20has%20also%20created%20other%20sources%20of%20income.%20I%20documented%20the%20construction%20process%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fmargo.does.stuff%2F%3Fhl%3Den%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eon%20social%20media%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20monetized%20the%20content.%20Within%20two%20years%2C%20that%20income%20covered%20the%20cost%20of%20building%20the%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20my%20following%20grew%2C%20it%20also%20led%20to%20more%20opportunities%20in%20the%20design%20world%2C%20including%20becoming%20a%20co-host%20of%20HGTV's%20%26quot%3BWorst%20Yard%20on%20the%20Block.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20seen%20tiny%20homes%20becoming%20more%20popular%2C%20especially%20with%20young%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20think%20it's%20because%2C%20for%20many%20of%20us%2C%20our%20salaries%20just%20aren't%20comparable%20to%20what%20our%20parents%20%E2%80%94%20or%20even%20Gen%20Xers%20and%20boomers%20%E2%80%94%20were%20making%20relative%20to%20the%20cost%20of%20a%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20also%20think%20a%20lot%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-people-are-buying-instead-of-home-down-payment-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eyounger%20people%20value%20experiences%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Instead%20of%20spending%20all%20their%20money%20on%20rent%20or%20a%20mortgage%2C%20they%20want%20to%20travel%2C%20and%20the%20expense%20and%20responsibility%20of%20maintaining%20a%20home%20can%20limit%20that%20freedom%20a%20bit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221206%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Margo%20Fairchild%20stands%20in%20a%20tiny%20home%20kitchen%20with%20plants%2C%20a%20loft%20bed%2C%20a%20couch%2C%20and%20wood%20floors%20in%20the%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6d3139a62e6e00bc53962f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22905%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMargo%20Fairchild%20built%20a%20240-square-foot%20tiny%20home%20by%20herself.%3Cp%3ESage%20Roddy%2FTiny%20Home%20Tours%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20advice%20to%20anyone%20who%20wants%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-a-genx-tech-salesman-built-tiny-home-for-45k-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebuild%20a%20tiny%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20to%20find%20a%20support%20system.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20doesn't%20have%20to%20be%20family%20or%20friends.%20Look%20for%20online%20forums%20or%20communities%20where%20you%20can%20turn%20on%20the%20difficult%20days%20%E2%80%94the%20ones%20when%20you're%20asking%20yourself%2C%20%26quot%3BWhat%20am%20I%20doing%3F%20Who%20do%20I%20think%20I%20am%20to%20believe%20I%20can%20do%20this%3F%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHearing%20fr