.%20Or%20at%20least%20%3Cem%3Ethat%3C%2Fem%3E%20young!%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20still%20going%20to%20the%20clubs%2C%20but%20you%20won't%20catch%20me%20at%20the%20Venetian%20food%20court%20anymore.%20Dining%20in%20Sin%20City%20has%20never%20been%20better%2C%20and%20I%20treat%20each%20visit%20as%20an%20opportunity%20to%20explore.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20my%20most%20recent%20Vegas%20trip%20to%20review%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flisa-vanderpump-hotel-las-vegas-review-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EThe%20Vanderpump%20Hotel%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20got%20the%20chance%20to%20try%20three%20very%20different%20restaurants%20by%20three%20very%20big%20names%3A%20Lisa%20Vanderpump%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-easy-pasta-recipes-ranked%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGordon%20Ramsay%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fday-in-the-life-celebrity-chef-giada-de-laurentiis-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGiada%20De%20Laurentiis%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20were%20highs%2C%20there%20were%20lows%2C%20there%20were%20cocktails%20covered%20in%20smoke.%20There%20were%20birdcages%20stuffed%20with%20charcuterie%2C%20towers%20stacked%20with%20crostini%20and%20crepes%2C%20and%20who%20could%20forget%20the%20world's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freview-gordon-ramsay-beef-wellington-first-time-worth-it-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emost%20famous%20beef%20Wellington%3C%2Fa%3E%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20how%20it%20all%20went.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMy%20first%20meal%20of%20the%20trip%20was%20lunch%20at%20Giada%2C%20located%20at%20the%20brand-new%20Vanderpump%20Hotel.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Vanderpump%20Hotel%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4e7d90b3a8c16f7e8ec7e5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJacob%20Kepler%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EGiada%20was%20De%20Laurentiis'%20very%20first%20restaurant%2C%20opening%20at%20The%20Cromwell%20hotel%20in%20the%20heart%20of%20the%20Las%20Vegas%20Strip%20in%20June%202014.%20The%20property%20has%20since%20been%20completely%20revamped%20by%20Vanderpump%20and%20now%20bears%20her%20name%2C%20but%20Giada%20remains%20in%20the%20same%20space.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EWhen%20I%20walked%20into%20the%20restaurant%2C%20something%20about%20the%20interior%20design%20felt%20distinctly%20'90s.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22GIADA%20restaurant%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a63e3d1ce52cb26b8393e15%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJacob%20Kepler%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20nearly%20orange%20glow%20of%20the%20lighting%20and%20the%20multicolored%20patterns%20on%20the%20chairs%20made%20me%20feel%20like%20I%20was%20back%20in%20a%20quirky%20coffee%20shop%20from%20my%20childhood.%20Waiting%20on%20each%20marble%20table%20were%20red%20water%20glasses%20decorated%20with%20stars%20and%20salmon-pink%20cloth%20napkins.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20friend%20Kayla%20and%20I%20sat%20down%20in%20a%20comfy%20crescent-shaped%20booth%20that%20faced%20the%20floor-to-ceiling%20windows%2C%20offering%20front-row%20seats%20to%20the%20Strip.%20Our%20server%20said%20the%20view%20was%20even%20better%20at%20night%2C%20when%20everything%20was%20lit%20up%20and%20you%20could%20watch%20the%20Fountains%20of%20Bellagio.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EWe%20decided%20to%20start%20with%20the%20%2440%20Brunch%20Favorites%20Tower.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Brunch%20Favorites%20Tower%20at%20GIADA%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9d5854f9875261777102%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20loved%20the%20crostini%2C%20which%20arrived%20in%20thin%20logs%20with%20a%20generous%20piping%20of%20ricotta%20on%20top.%20The%20cheese%20was%20lightly%20kissed%20with%20truffle%20and%20hot%20honey%2C%20creating%20a%20sweet-and-savory%20bite%20that%20felt%20indulgent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20crepes%20%E2%80%94%20which%20came%20with%20either%20Nutella%20and%20strawberry%20or%20smoked%20salmon%20and%20caviar%20%E2%80%94%20were%20less%20impressive.%20The%20savory%20crepe%20was%20surprisingly%20bland%2C%20and%20we%20couldn't%20taste%20any%20of%20the%20caviar.%20The%20bacon-wrapped%20dates%20at%20the%20bottom%20of%20the%20tower%20were%20a%20bit%20heavy%2C%20but%20the%20creamy%20gorgonzola%20dipping%20crema%20added%20some%20balance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ENext%20up%20was%20the%20chopped%20Italian%20salad.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Chopped%20Italian%20Salad%20at%20GIADA%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9d7954f9875261777109%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221740%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20figured%20we%20needed%20some%20balance%20before%20a%20round%20of%20pasta%2C%20but%20the%20chopped%20salad%20was%20lacking%20in%20ingredients%20and%20flavor.%20There%20wasn't%20enough%20salami%20or%20baby%20tomatoes%2C%20and%2C%20overall%2C%20everything%20needed%20a%20big%20punch%20of%20salt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20tried%20a%20couple%20of%20additional%20Giada%20appetizers%20while%20getting%20room%20service%20at%20The%20Vanderpump%20Hotel%20and%20would%20recommend%20the%20(really%20delicious)%20%2417%20orzo%20meatballs%20or%20%2434%20salumi%20and%20formaggi%20dish%20instead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EWe%20tried%20the%20breakfast%20risotto%2C%20rigatoni%20alla%20vodka%2C%20and%20cavatelli%20pasta%20for%20our%20entr%C3%A9es.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Dishes%20from%20Giada%20restaurant%20at%20The%20Vanderpump%20Hotel%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a39d3fed175c90a6a6fac1b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EJacob%20Kepler%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20star%20of%20the%20trio%20was%20the%20%2422%20rigatoni%20alla%20vodka%2C%20which%20features%20pomodoro%2C%20a%20dollop%20of%20ricotta%2C%20and%20basil.%20The%20noodles%2C%20covered%20in%20sauce%20and%20dusted%20in%20cheese%2C%20looked%20beautiful%20on%20the%20plate.%20Each%20bite%20was%20satisfyingly%20creamy%20and%20rich%2C%20with%20a%20hint%20of%20sweetness.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20also%20liked%20the%20breakfast%20risotto%2C%20a%20fun%20Italian-American%20fusion%20breakfast%20that%20featured%20sunny-side-up%20eggs%2C%20applewood-smoked%20bacon%2C%20and%20sugar%20snap%20peas.%20It%20wasn't%20the%20most%20memorable%20dish%2C%20but%20the%20risotto%20was%20cooked%20well%2C%20and%20I%20liked%20the%20extra%20crunch%20from%20the%20peas%20and%20bacon.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20least%20favorite%20dish%20of%20the%20day%20was%20the%20%2425%20cavatelli.%20We%20ordered%20the%20pasta%20since%20it%20uses%20the%20same%20lemon%20crema%20as%20the%20signature%20lemon%20spaghetti%20on%20Giada's%20dinner%20menu%2C%20but%20we%20could%20barely%20taste%20any%20lemon.%20The%20shrimp%20on%20top%20was%20dry%20and%20looked%20unappetizing%20against%20the%20pale%20cavatelli%2C%20which%20had%20been%20topped%20with%20crispy%20capers.%20Nothing%20about%20the%20dish%20seemed%20to%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Caesars%20representative%20declined%20to%20comment%20on%20the%20food%20at%20Giada.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20next%20day%2C%20we%20headed%20across%20the%20street%20to%20Caesars%20Palace%20for%20lunch%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Hell's%20Kitchen%20at%20Caesars%20Palace%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68d27fce52cb26b8394bab%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221303%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHell's%20Kitchen%20at%20Caesars%20Palace%20in%20Las%20Vegas.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Caesars%20Entertainment%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I've%20never%20seen%20%26quot%3BHell's%20Kitchen%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20is%20now%20in%20its%2025th%20season%2C%20I'm%20a%20huge%20fan%20of%20Gordon%20Ramsay.%20I've%20been%20to%20a%20number%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-restaurants-burgers-fish-and-chips-michelin-star-chef-2023-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehis%20restaurants%20in%20London%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20including%20his%20very%20fun%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-street-pizza-restaurant-review-2023-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebottomless%20pizza%20spot%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20and%20love%20whipping%20up%20his%20recipes%20at%20home%20(my%20favorite%20is%20his%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-easy-pasta-bolognese-recipe%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E15-minute%20Bolognese%3C%2Fa%3E).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20I%20was%20super%20excited%20to%20finally%20dine%20at%20one%20of%20his%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-hells-kitchen-restaurant-what-its-really-like-surprising-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EHell's%20Kitchen%20restaurants%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20all%20of%20which%20serve%20his%20signature%20beef%20Wellington%20dish.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20restaurant's%20interior%20is%20designed%20to%20make%20guests%20feel%20as%20if%20they're%20on%20the%20show's%20set.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221938%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Hell's%20Kitchen%20at%20Caesars%20Palace%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68d2cace52cb26b8394bb0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221159%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHell's%20Kitchen%20design%20was%20inspired%20by%20the%20set%20of%20Ramsay's%20show.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Caesars%20Entertainment%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20restaurant%20features%20a%20massive%20open%20kitchen%20split%20into%20a%20red%20and%20blue%20side%2C%20with%20chefs%20wearing%20either%20red%20or%20blue%20bandanas%20to%20signify%20their%20team%20%E2%80%94%20just%20like%20on%20the%20show.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDangling%20from%20the%20ceiling%20are%20dozens%20of%20light%20fixtures%20shaped%20like%20golden%20pitchforks%2C%20part%20of%20the%20series'%20iconic%20logo.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EWe%20decided%20to%20start%20our%20day%20with%20cocktails%20that%20we%20could%20eat%20and%20drink.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221862%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Shrimp%20Cocktail%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20Las%20Vegas%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9e1f54f9875261777114%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221504%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThere's%20nothing%20like%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-bloody-mary-pasta-recipe-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Egood%20Bloody%20Mary%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20or%20in%20this%20case%2C%20the%20Hell's%20Mary%20%E2%80%94%20to%20start%20your%20day%20in%20Vegas.%20Hell's%20Kitchen's%20%2425%20version%20includes%20Absolut%20Tabasco%20vodka%20mixed%20with%20a%20tomato-spice%20blend%20and%20a%20smoked%20paprika%20rim.%20It%20was%20one%20of%20the%20best%20Bloody%20Marys%20I've%20had%20in%20a%20long%20time%2C%20refreshing%20while%20still%20packing%20a%20spicy%20punch.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%2424%20shrimp%20cocktail%20was%20pretty%20pricey%20for%20four%20shrimp%2C%20but%20they%20were%20extremely%20plump%20and%20fresh%20%E2%80%94%20clearly%20high-quality.%20The%20bright%20and%20tangy%20gin%20cocktail%20sauce%20was%20so%20delicious%2C%20we%20swept%20up%20every%20last%20drop.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ENext%20up%20were%20the%20pan-seared%20scallops.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Pan-seared%20scallops%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20Las%20Vegas%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9df654f987526177710c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20someone%20who%20watches%20a%20lot%20of%20cooking%20competitions%2C%20I%20know%20how%20tricky%20scallops%20can%20be.%20I%20also%20learned%20that%20they're%20a%20frequent%20challenge%20on%20%26quot%3BHell's%20Kitchen%2C%26quot%3B%20with%20Ramsay%20known%20to%20scream%20%26quot%3BIT'S%20RAW%26quot%3B%20to%20anyone%20who%20dares%20undercook%20the%20pesky%20bivalve.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20was%20no%20such%20mistake%20during%20our%20lunch.%20The%20scallops%2C%20perched%20in%20a%20lovely%20citrus%20beurre%20blanc%2C%20were%20butter-soft.%20The%20bacon%20lardons%20provided%20some%20smoky%20crunch%20against%20their%20tender%20sweetness%2C%20and%20the%20English%20pea%20pur%C3%A9e%20added%20a%20beautiful%20burst%20of%20color.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20couldn't%20resist%20trying%20the%20onion%20soup.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Onion%20soup%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20Las%20Vegas%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9e7154f9875261777116%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you've%20read%20any%20of%20my%20cooking%20articles%2C%20you'll%20know%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fina-garten-easy-soup-recipes-ranked-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EI'm%20a%20massive%20soup%20fan%3C%2Fa%3E.%20I'm%20in%20a%20group%20chat%20dedicated%20to%20sharing%20pictures%20and%20soup%20recipes%20(shout-out%20to%20my%20%26quot%3Bsoup%20girlz%26quot%3B)%2C%20and%20I%20make%20a%20massive%20batch%20of%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fina-garten-homemade-chicken-stock-soup-recipe-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehomemade%20chicken%20stock%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0at%20least%20once%20a%20year.%20So%20the%20110-degree%20Vegas%20heat%20did%20not%20dissuade%20me%20from%20trying%20Ramsay's%20%2419%20onion%20soup.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20I'm%20so%20glad%2C%20because%20this%20dish%20truly%20felt%20gourmet.%20Mixed%20with%20lobster%2C%20black%20truffle%2C%20and%20potato%20hash%2C%20each%20sip%20was%20creamy%20and%20decadent.%20I%20would%20definitely%20order%20it%20again.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20beef%20Wellington%20lived%20up%20to%20its%20hype.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Beef%20Wellington%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20Las%20Vegas%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9e85548c9c486b30de1e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EEvery%20famous%20chef%20has%20their%20iconic%20dish.%20For%20Julia%20Child%2C%20it%20was%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fina-garten-and-julia-child-beef-bourguignon-compared-2022-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebeef%20bourguignon%3C%2Fa%3E.%20For%20Wolfgang%20Puck%2C%20it's%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwolfgang-puck-smoked-salmon-pizza-recipe-how-to-make-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esmoked%20salmon%20pizza%3C%2Fa%3E.%20And%20for%20Ramsay%2C%20it's%20beef%20Wellington.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20I've%20dined%20at%20a%20handful%20of%20Ramsay's%20restaurants%2C%20this%20was%20the%20first%20time%20I%20got%20to%20see%20his%20legendary%20recipe%20up%20close.%20The%20puff%20pastry%20that%20encased%20the%20beef%20had%20been%20baked%20to%20a%20beautiful%20caramel%20color%2C%20while%20the%20medium-rare%20filet%20glowed%20pink.%20Tucked%20into%20the%20accompanying%20potato%20pur%C3%A9e%20was%20a%20pool%20of%20red-wine%20demi-glace%2C%20presented%20without%20a%20drop%20out%20of%20place.%20It%20was%20a%20beautiful%20plate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20just%20like%20every%20other%20dish%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%2C%20the%20%2473.95%20beef%20Wellington%20was%20excellent.%20The%20puff%20pastry%20was%20flaky%20and%20warm%2C%20hugging%20the%20tender%20beef%20inside.%20I'd%20run%20each%20piece%20through%20the%20velvety%20potatoes%20for%20the%20perfect%20comforting%20bite.%20The%20flavors%20immediately%20brought%20me%20back%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-local-find-best-sunday-roast-london-2024-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESunday%20roast%20dinners%3C%2Fa%3E%20I'd%20eat%20while%20living%20in%20London.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20capped%20off%20our%20meal%20with%20the%20%2415.95%20sticky%20toffee%20pudding%2C%20which%20I%20highly%20recommend.%20It%20was%20the%20exact%20amount%20of%20sweetness%20we%20needed%20after%20such%20a%20big%20lunch.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EFor%20our%20last%20dinner%20in%20Vegas%2C%20we%20decided%20to%20travel%20to%20Vanderpump's%20Parisian%20escape%20%E2%80%94%20no%20passport%20required.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Vanderpump%20A%20Paris%20entrance%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ebc04d3a449ec3445f7b0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20addition%20to%20her%20hotel%2C%20Vanderpump%20has%20four%20restaurants%20and%20bars%20in%20Vegas%3A%20Pinky's%20at%20the%20Flamingo%2C%20Vanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris%20at%20Paris%20Las%20Vegas%2C%20Vanderpump%20Cocktail%20Garden%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmost-famous-hotel-every-state%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECaesars%20Palace%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20Gigolo%20at%20The%20Vanderpump%20Hotel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flisa-vanderpump-las-vegas-restaurants-bars-review-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EI%20tried%20all%20four%20places%20during%20my%20recent%20trip%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20going%20on%20my%20own%20Vanderpump%20Vegas%20crawl.%20Vanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris%20was%20one%20of%20my%20favorite%20spots%20thanks%20to%20its%20stunning%20decor%2C%20imaginative%20cocktails%2C%20and%20a%20delicious%20spread%20of%20carbs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EVanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris%20is%20designed%20to%20evoke%20a%20rainy%20night%20in%20the%20City%20of%20Light.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Inside%20Vanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6791ca54f987526177a2ed%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221335%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EInside%20Vanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris%20at%20the%20Paris%20Las%20Vegas%20hotel.%3Cp%3EErnesto%20Garrido%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20strolled%20beneath%20the%20restaurant's%20high%20stone%20archways%20and%20were%20transported%20into%20a%20moody%2C%20romantic%20space%20that%20felt%20worlds%20away%20from%20the%20nearby%20slot%20machines.%20The%20dim%20lighting%20and%20velvet%20purple%20booths%20made%20the%20restaurant%20feel%20cozy%2C%20while%20the%20chandeliers%2C%20marble%20tables%2C%20and%20fountains%20added%20drama%20and%20elegance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBehind%20the%20marble%20bar%2C%20you'll%20find%20a%20fake%20window%2C%20designed%20to%20look%20like%20raindrops%20on%20glass.%20Stare%20long%20enough%2C%20and%20you'll%20notice%20the%20Eiffel%20Tower%20winking%20back.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAfter%20ordering%20a%20round%20of%20espresso%20martinis%2C%20we%20dug%20into%20our%20first%20app.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Birdcage%20%C3%81%20Charcuterie%20at%20Vanderpump%20a%20Paris%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ebd46b3a8c16f7e8ecaa7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20love%20a%20good%20charcuterie%20board%2C%20so%20I%20couldn't%20resist%20trying%20Vanderpump's%20%2445%20Birdcage%20%C3%81%20Charcuterie.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20meats%20%E2%80%94%20including%20salami%2C%20capocollo%2C%20and%20mini%20baguette%20rosettes%2C%20a%20traditional%20French%20sandwich%20%E2%80%94%20were%20all%20delicious%2C%20and%20I%20loved%20the%20housemade%20potato%20chips%2C%20which%20were%20crisped%20to%20perfection.%20My%20one%20wish%20was%20that%20they%20had%20a%20creamy%20dipping%20sauce%20to%20offset%20that%20salty%20crunch.%20The%20birdcage%20comes%20with%20a%20sharp%20mustard%20for%20the%20meat%2C%20but%20it%20didn't%20pair%20well%20with%20the%20chips.%20Vanderpump%20has%20a%20fantastic%20Boursin%20dip%20at%20Gigolo%20that%20would%20be%20perfect%20for%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20%2430%20Truffle-Stuffed%20Vanderpump%20Baguette%20was%20my%20favorite%20dish%20of%20the%20night.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Truffle-Stuffed%20Vanderpump%20Baguette%20at%20Vanderpump%20a%20Paris%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ebf69d3a449ec3445f7c2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wasn't%20planning%20to%20dig%20into%20a%20baguette%20covered%20with%20black%20summer%20truffles%20and%20triple%20cr%C3%A8me%20Brie%20before%20a%20long%20night%20out%20in%20Vegas%2C%20but%2C%20honestly%2C%20I%20have%20no%20regrets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20golden%20baguette%20had%20a%20lovely%20crust%20that%20wasn't%20too%20crunchy%2C%20giving%20way%20to%20the%20ultra-creamy%20cheese.%20And%20the%20truffle%20honey%20added%20extra%20umami%20%E2%80%94%20it%20all%20tasted%20so%20decadent!%20I%20have%20thought%20about%20this%20baguette%20%3Cem%3Ea%20lot%3C%2Fem%3E%20since%20leaving%20Vegas.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAnd%20the%20Louvre%20at%20First%20Sight%20was%20the%20best%20cocktail%20of%20my%20entire%20trip.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Louvre%20at%20First%20Sight%20cocktail%20at%20Vanderpump%20a%20Paris%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ebe05b3a8c16f7e8ecaaa%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOnly%20the%20garnish%20of%20my%20%2427%20drink%20was%20visible%20at%20first%2C%20peeking%20through%20a%20miniature%20Louvre%20pyramid%20filled%20with%20smoke.%20Tendrils%20were%20already%20seeping%20from%20the%20base%2C%20turning%20the%20dinner%20table%20into%20our%20own%20little%20club.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20cloud%20of%20smoke%20escaped%20as%20the%20server%20lifted%20the%20case%2C%20revealing%20the%20pink%20mezcal%20cocktail%20sitting%20atop%20fresh%20flower%20petals.%20The%20drink%20was%20both%20smoky%20and%20sweet%2C%20with%20a%20lovely%20freshness%20from%20the%20prickly%20pear%20and%20a%20kick%20of%20jalape%C3%B1o%20honey.%20It%20went%20down%20easily%20(and%20quickly).%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EWe%20also%20tried%20the%20%2450%20Lovelocked%2C%20which%20comes%20with%20two%20cocktails%2C%20plus%20a%20padlock%2C%20key%2C%20and%20marker.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lovelocked%20cocktails%20at%20Vanderpump%20a%20Paris%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ec113d3a449ec3445f7cb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20drink%20was%20inspired%20by%20Paris'%20former%20Love%20Lock%20Bridge%2C%20which%20nearly%20sank%20from%20the%20weight%20of%20one%20million%20tourists'%20pledges%20of%20love.%20Now%20you%20can%20re-create%20the%20moment%20at%20Vanderpump's%20%26quot%3BWall%20of%20Love.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20concept%20was%20cute%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20love%20the%20gin%20and%20hibiscus%20drink%20as%20much%20as%20the%20Louvre%20at%20First%20Sight%2C%20which%20provided%20more%20flavor%20and%20drama%20at%20a%20lower%20price.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20%2423%20Mini%20Monsieurs%20were%20delicious%2C%20but%20I%20wouldn't%20recommend%20ordering%20them%20alongside%20the%20baguette.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mini%20Monsieurs%20at%20Vanderpump%20a%20Paris%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4ebeb3d3a449ec3445f7bb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20ordered%20our%20entr%C3%A9es%20after%20a%20few%20cocktails%2C%20which%20is%20probably%20why%20I%20decided%20on%20sandwiches%20stuffed%20with%20Gruy%C3%A8re%20and%20covered%20in%20b%C3%A9chamel%2C%20along%20with%20a%20%2417%20tub%20of%20Gruy%C3%A8re%20frites.%20If%20I'm%20having%20more%20than%20one%20drink%2C%20an%20order%20of%20fries%20is%20almost%20guaranteed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20frites%20were%20deliciously%20seasoned%2C%20and%20the%20Mini%20Monsieurs%20were%20a%20cheesy%20dream.%20But%20overall%2C%20there%20were%20too%20many%20carbs%20for%20one%20meal%2C%20a%20fault%20of%20my%20own%20ordering!%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20were%20completely%20stuffed%2C%20but%20when%20the%20waiter%20asked%20if%20we%20wanted%20dessert%2C%20how%20could%20we%20say%20no%3F%20The%20%2416%20Rose%20%26amp%3B%20Ros%C3%A9%20Eclairs%20are%20light%2C%20bite-sized%2C%20and%20a%20nice%20little%20treat%20to%20end%20the%20night.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThere%20was%20never%20a%20dull%20moment%20during%20my%20Vegas%20feast%2C%20but%20there%20was%20a%20clear%20favorite.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221512%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Anneta%20at%20GIADA%20in%20Las%20Vegas%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5d9d95548c9c486b30de17%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222016%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAnneta%20Konstantinides%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFrom%20the%20cocktails%20to%20the%20dessert%2C%20every%20dish%20at%20Hell's%20Kitchen%20was%20perfectly%20executed.%20If%20this%20were%20a%20competition%2C%20Ramsay%20would%20have%20won%20easily.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20that's%20not%20to%20say%20I%20wouldn't%20go%20back%20to%20Vanderpump%20%C3%A0%20Paris%20for%20another%20smoking%20cocktail%20and%20truffle-stuffed%20baguette.%20And%20if%20you're%20staying%20at%20The%20Vanderpump%20Hotel%2C%20I%20highly%20recommend%20ordering%20Giada's%20orzo%20meatballs%20and%20the%20salumi%20and%20formaggi%20plate%20for%20room%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20best%20part%20about%20Vegas%20is%20that%20there's%20truly%20something%20for%20every%20mood%20at%20every%20hour%20%E2%80%94%20even%20a%2040-piece%20chicken-nugget%20box%2C%20if%20that's%20what%20your%20young%20heart%20desires.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgordon-ramsay-lisa-vanderpump-giada-de-laurentiis-vegas-restaurants-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785672961000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68df4d54f987526177a9c1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.busine