5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2F52-cant-find-job-in-field-wasnt-expecting-shame-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estruggled%20to%20find%20a%20job%3C%2Fa%3E%20since%20then.%20This%20is%20the%20first%20time%20in%20my%20life%20that%20I%20don't%20know%20that%20I'll%20have%20a%20happy%20ending.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EIn%20%3Cstrong%3EStill%20in%20the%20Game%3C%2Fstrong%3E%2C%20Business%20Insider%20is%20chronicling%20the%20realities%20of%20job%20hunting%20in%20your%2050s%20%E2%80%94%20from%20overcoming%20age%20bias%20and%20navigating%20career%20transitions%20to%20rebuilding%20confidence%2C%20updating%20skills%2C%20and%20finding%20new%20opportunities%20in%20a%20competitive%20job%20market.%20%3Cstrong%3ERead%20more%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fquit-job-at-53-using-multi-month-exit-plan-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Estories%20here%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%2C%20and%20share%20your%20own%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%20nofollow%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fforms%2Fd%2Fe%2F1FAIpQLSccQpfEcrqRQYBkOxaEN81bwmjSfbzsfVIaie717b81D9EUXw%2Fviewform%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Eexperience%20here%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EI%20know%20I'll%20be%20OK%2C%20but%20that%20might%20mean%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20moving%20in%20with%20my%20mother%2C%20selling%20our%20house%2C%20or%20draining%20my%20401(k).%20It%20feels%20like%20I%20am%20standing%20on%20the%20precipice%20of%20failure%2C%20and%20it's%20an%20uncomfortable%20place%20to%20be%2C%20but%20it's%20not%20over.%20Here's%20what%20I'm%20doing%20to%20get%20by.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2223b03ef4-bbe1-48de-9560-128f8972375a%5C%22%3EI'm%20learning%20new%20skills%20to%20create%20more%20job%20opportunities%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20first%20started%20applying%20to%20jobs%2C%20I%20was%20looking%20exclusively%20for%20in-person%20jobs%20because%20my%20role%20in%20operations%20management%20in%20healthcare%20requires%20me%20to%20be%20at%20the%20facility%20where%20I%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20found%20that%20many%20organizations%20are%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmiddle-managers-have-more-direct-reports-after-great-flattening-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eeliminating%20middle%20management%20roles%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20making%20it%20harder%20to%20find%20jobs%20that%20use%20my%20skill%20set%2C%20so%20I've%20started%20applying%20to%20remote%20roles%20as%20well%20on%20job%20boards%20and%20directly%20through%20company%20websites.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20trying%20to%20diversify%20my%20skills%2C%20so%20I'm%20taking%20a%20coding%20in%20healthcare%20course.%20It%20was%20a%20part%20of%20my%20most%20recent%20job%20that%20I%20enjoyed%20a%20lot.%20It's%20not%20patient-facing%2C%20meaning%20it's%20not%20necessarily%20a%20job%20that%20requires%20me%20to%20be%20in%20a%20hospital%20or%20even%20in%20person.%20That%20allows%20me%20to%20look%20into%20remote%20opportunities%20and%20office%20job%20opportunities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2267e7aeb7-2602-48f8-94ea-908d24153229%5C%22%3EI'm%20digging%20into%20my%20401k%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20now%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Finvesting%2F401k-early-withdrawal%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eeating%20into%20my%20401(k)%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20I%20don't%20know%20what%20to%20do.%20My%20husband%20works%2C%20but%20losing%20my%20salary%20has%20been%20financially%20devastating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20wondering%20whether%20we%20should%20move%20somewhere%20else%20that's%20less%20expensive%2C%20but%20I%20don't%20know%20what's%20best.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20mom%20has%20been%20really%20supportive%2C%20and%20my%20husband%20has%20helped%20me%20look%20for%20jobs.%20He%20knows%20that%20it's%20not%20as%20simple%20as%20throwing%20my%20r%C3%A9sum%C3%A9%20online%20and%20getting%20jumped%20on%20to%20get%20a%20job.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22333d64fe-96b5-4457-916b-4b0fdfa00184%5C%22%3EMy%20family%20has%20stepped%20in%20to%20help%20me%20feel%20better%20about%20my%20situation%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20adult%20son%2C%20who%20lives%20at%20home%2C%20keeps%20trying%20to%20get%20me%20to%20go%20outside%20and%20garden%2C%20even%20though%20I%20have%20a%20track%20record%20of%20killing%20plants.%20My%20family%20is%20trying%20to%20help%20in%20their%20own%20way%2C%20especially%20by%20getting%20me%20out%20of%20the%20house.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20also%20been%20teaching%20my%20son%20to%20drive%2C%20which%20really%20gets%20me%20out%20of%20my%20own%20head.%20Believe%20it%20or%20not%2C%20they%20help%20by%20not%20pushing.%20They%20know%20I'm%20doing%20everything%20I%20can%20at%20this%20point.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22dc1a5ee5-bf38-4f4a-8515-a0e2184e17fb%5C%22%3EI%20feel%20like%20age%20is%20a%20factor%2C%20and%20it%20makes%20me%20feel%20invisible%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20feel%20like%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2F50-unemployed-worried-hiring-managers-see-desperation-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eage%20is%20a%20factor%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20why%20I've%20struggled%20to%20get%20hired%2C%20although%20I%20don't%20understand%20why.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJust%20because%20I'm%20in%20my%2050s%20doesn't%20mean%20my%20brain%20doesn't%20function%20well%20enough%20to%20do%20the%20job.%20I%20have%20a%20lot%20of%20life%20experience%20and%20can%20handle%20stressful%20situations.%20In%20my%20previous%20jobs%2C%20I%20had%20people%20who%20relied%20on%20me%20and%20my%20expertise%20on%20a%20daily%20basis%20to%20help%20them%20find%20solutions.%20I%20went%20from%20playing%20an%20important%20role%20%E2%80%94%20having%20a%20purpose%20%E2%80%94%20to%20feeling%20like%20nothing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20feels%20like%20being%20in%20the%20sixth%20grade%20and%20not%20getting%20chosen%20for%20dodgeball.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220bc44249-d58e-4ff5-a9a1-cd5b3d6a2240%5C%22%3EI%20have%20days%20when%20I%20wonder%20what%20the%20point%20is%20of%20getting%20dressed%2C%20but%20I'm%20rejecting%20those%20feelings%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20try%20not%20to%20dwell%20on%20that%20feeling%2C%20but%20there%20are%20times%20I%20think%20about%20doing%20something%20like%20vacuuming%20the%20house%2C%20and%20I%20think%2C%20%26quot%3BWhat's%20the%20point%20of%20that%2C%20too%3F%26quot%3B%20It's%20crushing%20to%20go%20from%20being%20a%20rock%20for%20so%20many%20people%20to%20feeling%20irrelevant%20and%20unnecessary.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20daily%20struggle%20is%20not%20to%20give%20in%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-get-past-your-failures-2019-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efeelings%20of%20failure%3C%2Fa%3E.%20To%20see%20it%2C%20own%20it%2C%20feel%20it%2C%20and%20then%20reject%20it.%20I%20have%20days%20when%20I%20want%20to%20give%20up%2C%20but%20I%20won't.%20If%20I%20could%20tell%20anybody%20else%20going%20through%20this%20situation%20anything%2C%20I'd%20say%20don't%20let%20this%20be%20the%20ending%20of%20your%20story.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EAre%20you%20navigating%20a%20career%20change%20in%20your%2050s%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Atmartinelli%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Etmartinelli%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20to%20share%20your%20story.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcant-find-job-50s-401k-failure-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785669061000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a68c892ce52cb26b8394b47%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcant-find-job-50s-401k-failure-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22A%20middle%20manager%20was%20laid%20off%20in