3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EYears%20ago%2C%20I%20started%20my%20own%20business%2C%20thinking%20the%20flexibility%20would%20be%20good%20for%20starting%20a%20family.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ENow%2C%20I%20can%20see%20that%20wasn't%20always%20the%20case%20and%20I%20have%20some%20regrets.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMy%20adult%20sons%20turned%20out%20well%2C%20but%20if%20i%20had%20it%20to%20do%20over%20again%2C%20I%20might%20make%20different%20choices.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%20married%20in%20April%20of%202000%20after%20living%20with%20my%20now-ex-husband%20for%20several%20years.%20At%20the%20time%2C%20I%20made%20a%20good%20living%20from%20my%20job%20in%20advertising%2C%20and%20like%20many%20of%20my%20colleagues%2C%20I'd%20been%20doing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmost-lucrative-side-hustles-tried-no-experience-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efreelance%20work%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20the%20side%20for%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202001%2C%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20became%20proud%20homeowners%2C%20one%20of%20the%20many%20Americans%20who%20used%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpersonal-finance%2Fmortgages%2Fsubprime-mortgage%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esubprime%20mortgage%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20early%202000s%20to%20finance%20our%20first%20home%2C%20all%20my%20idea.%20We%20even%20leased%20a%20new%20car%20that%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20came%209%2F11.%20Amidst%20the%20tragedy%2C%20the%20advertising%20industry%20ground%20to%20a%20halt.%20When%20I%20got%20laid%20off%20that%20year%2C%20I%20took%20the%20opportunity%20to%20start%20my%20own%20marketing%20consultancy.%20I'd%20been%20talking%20about%20going%20out%20on%20my%20own%20for%20years%2C%20and%20it%20seemed%20like%20the%20right%20time%20to%20take%20the%20plunge%3B%20after%20all%2C%20we%20were%20talking%20about%20starting%20a%20family%2C%20and%20working%20for%20myself%20would%20give%20me%20the%20flexibility%20I'd%20need%20as%20a%20mother.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20thought%20it%20was%20a%20foolproof%20plan.%20Now%2C%20more%20than%20two%20decades%20later%2C%20I%20look%20back%20and%20see%20how%20naive%20I%20was.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229c49c14a-303c-40ca-8eeb-8113efdb8ce8%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20started%20a%20business%20and%20our%20family%20simultaneously%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20I%20got%20my%20business%20off%20the%20ground%2C%20with%20all%20the%20stops%20and%20starts%20that%20entailed%2C%20I%20soon%20found%20myself%20incubating%20another%20project%3A%20In%20late%20Spring%202002%2C%20I%20got%20pregnant%20with%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-i-wish-i-knew-about-pregnancy-before-getting-pregnant-2022-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efirst%20child%3C%2Fa%3E.%20My%20first%20pregnancy%20was%20eventful%20to%20say%20the%20least%2C%20but%20after%20spending%20most%20of%20the%20last%20three%20weeks%20in%20the%20hospital%2C%20I%20delivered%20a%20beautiful%20baby%20boy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20is%20no%20%26quot%3Bright%26quot%3B%20or%20%26quot%3Bperfect%26quot%3B%20time%20to%20have%20a%20baby.%20I%20firmly%20believe%20that.%20However%2C%20I%20either%20overlooked%20or%20blocked%20out%20one%20key%20fact%20that's%20important%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsolopreneur-ai-agents-dont-need-to-hire-staff-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esolopreneur%20moms%3C%2Fa%3E%20without%20a%20financial%20cushion%3A%20Even%20as%20I%20was%20healing%20from%20major%20abdominal%20surgery%2C%20and%20getting%20to%20know%20this%20actual%20human%20being%20I'd%20just%20brought%20into%20the%20world%2C%20I'd%20still%20need%20to%20be%20earning%20money.%20We%20had%20bills%20to%20pay.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20a%20result%2C%20the%20memory%20that's%20seared%20into%20my%20mind%20from%20my%20first%20days%20at%20home%20with%20my%20gorgeous%20newborn%20boy%20is%20of%20sitting%20in%20my%20bed%20furiously%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fexcerpt-maternal-hope-camille-seigle-ali-mann-stevens-postpartum-motherhood-2025-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etyping%20away%20on%20my%20laptop%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20one%20side%20of%20my%20body%20while%20simultaneously%20nursing%20him%20on%20the%20other.%20I'd%20cradle%20both%20the%20baby%20and%20the%20computer%20on%20my%20nursing%20pillow%20at%20all%20hours%20of%20the%20day%20and%20night%20in%20an%20effort%20to%20be%20productive%3B%20that%2C%20looking%20back%20on%20it%2C%20bordered%20on%20lunacy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20did%20the%20same%20thing%20three%20years%20later%20when%20his%20baby%20brother%20came%20along.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e8d87ca8-f587-4f96-ab9f-61be60ed1b02%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20have%20regrets%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20think%20about%20those%20days%2C%20I%20can%20see%20how%20comical%20that%20picture%20is%2C%20and%20I%20feel%20a%20little%20sorry%20for%20myself.%20But%20I%20also%20know%20that%20I%20was%20determined%20to%20do%20whatever%20it%20took%20to%20power%20through%20the%20situation.%20I%20am%20incredibly%20grateful%20to%20have%20the%20ability%20to%20make%20a%20living%20working%20for%20myself%2C%20but%20during%20that%20time%2C%20I%20cheated%20my%20clients%20out%20of%20my%20best%20efforts%2C%20and%20more%20importantly%2C%20I%20cheated%20both%20myself%20and%20my%20sons%20out%20of%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsingle-mother-success-jamilah-lemieux-book-excerpt-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eearly%20time%3C%2Fa%3E%20together.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20perhaps%20the%20most%20ridiculous%20example%20of%20how%20desperate%20I%20was%20to%20keep%20all%20the%20balls%20in%20the%20air%2C%20I%20was%20late%20to%20my%20scheduled%20C-section%20for%20my%20younger%20son%20because%20I%20was%20trying%20to%20finish%20up%20a%20work%20project.%20We%20laugh%20about%20it%20now%2C%20but%20at%20the%20time%2C%20I%20was%20getting%20it%20from%20all%20sides.%20There%20I%20was%2C%20trying%20desperately%20to%20wrap%20up%20a%20job%20for%20a%20client%20who%20had%20no%20idea%20I%20was%20supposed%20to%20be%20headed%20to%20the%20hospital%20%E2%80%94%20I%20never%20told%20clients%20how%20far%20along%20I%20was%20for%20fear%20I'd%20lose%20work%20%E2%80%94%20and%20he%20was%20yelling%20at%20me%20because%20the%20project%20was%20clearly%20finished%20in%20a%20rush.%20Meanwhile%2C%20my%20then-husband%20was%20perturbed%20and%20exasperated%2C%20in%20utter%20disbelief%20that%20we%20were%20actually%20going%20to%20be%20late%20to%20our%20own%20son's%20birth%20because%20I%20wouldn't%20get%20off%20the%20computer.%20I%20just%20wanted%20to%20bill%20the%20job%20so%20I%20could%20have%20a%20minute%20to%20breathe.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EExcept%20there%20never%20was%20a%20minute%20to%20breathe.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2264581edc-9854-438e-ae46-9cca3df81388%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI'm%20not%20sure%20things%20are%20any%20better%20for%20new%20moms%20now%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20it%20makes%20me%20furious%20that%20the%20United%20States%20can't%20get%20its%20act%20together%20on%20paid%20maternity%20leave%2C%20it's%20my%20biggest%20personal%20regret%20as%20a%20parent%20that%20I%20didn't%20somehow%20plan%20that%20time%20better%2C%20so%20that%20my%20babies%20and%20I%20could%20have%20had%20those%20important%20days%20and%20weeks%20together%20without%20so%20much%20stress.%20Those%20early%20days%20with%20an%20infant%20are%20impossible%20to%20recapture.%20But%20I%20wonder%2C%20in%20order%20to%20do%20this%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fshonda-rhimes-working-mother-relief-perfect-career-kids-lean-in-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eany%20kind%20of%20sanity%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20are%20women%2C%20are%20people%2C%20being%20priced%20out%20of%20having%20babies%20these%20days%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20woman%20who%20does%20my%20hair%20recently%20told%20me%20that%20she%20is%20pregnant.%20She's%20doing%20it%20on%20her%20own%2C%20and%20she%2C%20of%20course%2C%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoms-childcare-return-to-office-job-searching-labor-force-participation-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eowns%20her%20own%20business%3C%2Fa%3E.%20She's%20already%20planned%20out%20her%20maternity%20leave%2C%20and%20after%20a%20short%20time%20away%2C%20will%20initially%20come%20back%20to%20work%20part-time.%20I%20feel%20strangely%20proud%20of%20her.%20I'm%20proud%20of%20her%20for%20figuring%20out%20another%20way%2C%20and%20for%20having%20the%20financial%20wherewithal%20to%20carve%20out%20time%20to%20be%20with%20her%20daughter.%20I%20know%20she's%20worried%2C%20even%20though%20she%20doesn't%20show%20it.%20But%20she%20has%20a%20village%20around%20her%2C%20and%20I%20hope%20to%20be%20part%20of%20that%20village%20so%20that%20if%20she%20needs%20support%2C%20she'll%20get%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20for%20my%20sons%2C%20both%20are%20wonderful%20young%20men%20in%20their%20early%2020s%20now%20and%20I'm%20very%20proud%20of%20them.%20Clearly%2C%20they%20don't%20remember%20those%20days%20when%20they%20were%20infants%2C%20and%20I%20was%20juggling%20breastfeeding%20and%20my%20laptop%2C%20but%20I%20do.%20And%20sometimes%20it%20breaks%20my%20heart.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmother-entrepreneur-started-business-has-regrets-about-work-life-balance-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785664201000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6b4ed654f987526177b9b8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmother-entrepreneur-started-business-has-regrets-about-work-life-balance-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20freedom%20of%20self-employment%20came%20with%20the%20motherhood%20cost%20I%20never%20saw%20coming.%20Instead%20of%20more%20flexibility%2C%20I%20got%20more%20stress.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Julie%20Peck)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22ca