EJon%20Gray%20and%20summer%20analysts%20ran%20through%20Central%20Park%20on%20Thursday.%3Cp%3EBlackstone%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI%20went%20running%20with%20Jon%20Gray%2C%20Blackstone's%20president%20and%20chief%20operating%20officer%2C%20and%20analysts.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EGray's%20running%20videos%20have%20gone%20viral%2C%20and%20I%20felt%20firsthand%20why%20they're%20a%20good%20business%20strategy.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAfter%20the%20run%2C%20a%20sweaty%20Gray%20talked%20to%20me%20about%20navigating%20social%20media%20as%20a%20young%20person%20at%20his%20firm.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAround%207%3A15%20am%20on%20Thursday%2C%20a%20photographer%20in%20a%20golf%20cart%20trailed%20a%20gaggle%20of%20young%20runners%20in%20matching%20black%20shirts%20through%20the%20southern%20corner%20of%20Central%20Park.%20This%20wasn't%20some%20Instagram-ready%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgen-z-running-marathons-ultras-ironmans-extreme-fitness-competitions-2025-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGen%20Z%20run%20club%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20had%20potentially%20as%20much%20virality%2C%20if%20not%20more%2C%20since%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fprofile-blackstone-president-jon-gray-billionaire-real-estate-bumble-ipo-2021-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EJon%20Gray%2C%20Blackstone's%20president%20%3C%2Fa%3Eand%20unlikely%20short-form%20video%20star%2C%20was%20leading%20the%20pack.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20joined%20Gray%20and%20more%20than%20110%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjon-gray-blackstone-interns-success-steve-schwarzman2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Einterns%2C%20first-year%20analysts%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20pre-MBA%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Esummer%20associates%20for%20a%20group%20run%20%E2%80%94%20and%20yes%2C%20it%20really%20was%20a%20run%2C%20since%20even%20those%20of%20us%20at%20the%20back%20kept%20a%20pace%20of%209%3A22%20per%20mile%2C%20according%20to%20my%20Strava.%20The%20event%20was%20inspired%20by%20Gray's%20hugely%20popular%20running%20videos%20on%20LinkedIn%2C%20which%20are%20peppered%20with%20business%20advice%20and%20can%20rack%20up%20millions%20of%20views.%20Gray%20keeps%20the%20videos%20surprisingly%20casual%2C%20considering%20he's%20the%20heir%20apparent%20to%20a%20firm%20that%20manages%20more%20than%20%241%20trillion%20in%20assets.%20He%20usually%20talks%20straight%20to%20the%20camera%2C%20wearing%20AirPods%20and%20shiny%20with%20sweat%2C%20which%20he%20told%20me%20is%20part%20of%20the%20appeal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20felt%20that%20appeal%20firsthand%20on%20Thursday%20morning%2C%20when%20Gray%20brought%20much%20of%20the%20same%20energy%20and%20spent%20a%20few%20minutes%20mingling%20with%20employees%20outside%20the%20park.%20Before%20taking%20off%2C%20Gray%20paused%20to%20honor%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fblackstone-real-estate-executive-wesley-lepatner-killed-gunman-345-park-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EWesley%20LePatner%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20Blackstone%20real%20estate%20executive%20who%20was%20killed%20in%20the%20shooting%20at%20the%20firm's%20headquarters%20last%20year.%20He%20remembered%20her%20as%20someone%20committed%20to%20mentoring%20younger%20employees%E2%80%94a%20fitting%20note%20before%20spending%20the%20next%2020%20minutes%20running%20through%20Central%20Park%20with%20junior%20staff.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wasn't%20at%20the%20front%20of%20the%20running%20pack%20with%20Gray%20and%20the%20associate%20holding%20a%20ginormous%20Blackstone%20flag%2C%20but%20everyone%20near%20me%20seemed%20pretty%20relaxed%2C%20apart%20from%20when%20we%20went%20uphill.%20(I%2C%20at%20an%20imposing%205'2%2C%20shared%20a%20quiet%20nod%20with%20the%20person%20who%20complained%20of%20the%20%26quot%3Blong%20legs%20up%20front.%26quot%3B)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20New%20Yorkers%20were%20amused%2C%20like%20the%20older%20speedwalking%20gentleman%20who%20got%20stuck%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20our%20group%2C%20but%20told%20me%20he%20didn't%20mind.%20Another%20man%20and%20his%20very%20small%2C%20very%20upset%20dog%20weren't%20quite%20so%20generous%2C%20telling%20us%20that%20we%20were%20%26quot%3Bnot%20inconvenient%20at%20all!%26quot%3B%20And%20to%20all%20the%20bikers%20attempting%20to%20navigate%20our%20herd%2C%20consider%20this%20an%20official%20apology.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFew%20of%20the%20Blackstone%20employees%20wore%20headphones%2C%20opting%20instead%20to%20talk%20to%20each%20other%20throughout%20the%20two-mile%20loop.%20They%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Edidn't%20seem%20hyper-aware%20of%20running%20with%20Gray%2C%20a%20titan%20of%20finance%20and%20their%20ultimate%20boss%2C%20which%20proved%20how%20successful%20his%20affable%20running%20videos%20and%20vibe%20are.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20Gray's%20own%20admission%2C%20the%20videos%20have%20a%20business%20objective%3A%20they%20allow%20him%20to%20communicate%20Blackstone's%20goals%20and%20brand%20at%20scale%2C%20to%20investors%20and%20potential%20talent%20alike.%20He's%20by%20no%20means%20the%20only%20executive%20to%20lean%20into%20social%20media%20%E2%80%94%20remember%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmcdonalds-ceo-chris-kempczinski-big-arch-burger-review-social-media-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EMcDonald's%20CEO%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20anyone%3F%20%E2%80%94%20but%20is%20uniquely%20successful.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20more%20human%20they%20are%2C%20the%20more%20they%20connect%20with%20people%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20told%20me.%20%26quot%3BBut%20it%20has%20to%20feel%20right.%20It%20has%20to%20be%20authentic.%20If%20it%20becomes%20overly%20produced%20or%20scripted%2C%20I%20don't%20think%20it%20works.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20same%20thing%20goes%20for%20this%20run%2C%20which%20got%20a%20slightly%20more%20polished%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fupdate%2Furn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7489019102590738432%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Evideo%20of%20its%20own%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Gray%20said.%20He%20got%20to%20connect%20with%20analysts%20and%20associates%2C%20the%20latter%20were%20part%20of%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fblackstone-career-path-internship-former-ny-knick-marshall-plumlee-2024-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eprogram%20for%20military%20veterans%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20more%20intimately%20than%20when%20he%20spots%20them%20at%20the%20back%20of%20a%20big%20investment%20committee%20room.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20interesting%20%E2%80%94%20it's%20allowing%20you%20to%20communicate%20at%20scale%2C%20but%20the%20beauty%20of%20it%20is%2C%20it%20allows%20for%20this%20one-on-one%20communication%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%2C%20though%20I%20couldn't%20tell%20if%20he%20was%20talking%20about%20the%20morning%20jog%20or%20the%20videos%20he%20films%20from%20all%20over%20the%20globe.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20least%20some%20of%20the%20young%20Blackstone%20employees%20knew%20of%20Gray's%20videos%20before%20joining%20the%20firm.%20Abigail%20Miles%2C%20a%20first-year%20analyst%20on%20the%20private%20credit%20strategies%20team%2C%20said%20she'd%20watch%20them%20%26quot%3Ball%20the%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20that%20other%20executives%20should%20adopt%20a%20similar%20social%20media%20strategy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20think%20it's%20really%20important%2C%20especially%20at%20a%20junior%20level%2C%20to%20see%20senior%20leadership%20and%20recognize%20that%20they're%20people%2C%20too%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMiles%2C%2021%2C%20added%20that%20Thursday's%20run%20deepened%20her%20respect%20for%20Gray's%20hustle%2C%20since%20he%20finds%20time%20to%20run%20and%20film%20while%20working%20such%20a%20high-intensity%20job.%20Cy%20Aminzadeh%2C%2022%2C%20and%20another%20first-year%20analyst%2C%20said%20the%20slight%20cringe%20factor%20actually%20helps%20the%20content.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHe's%20such%20a%20giant%20in%20the%20finance%20world%2C%20and%20for%20us%20young%20people%20at%20the%20beginning%20of%20our%20careers%20who%20look%20up%20to%20him%20in%20so%20many%20ways%2C%20seeing%20him%20being%20normal%20and%20so%20down%20to%20earth%2C%20and%20doing%20things%20that%20our%20dad%20would%20do%2C%20or%20that%20we%20would%20do%20%E2%80%94%20it%20humanizes%20him%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20compliance%20team%20reviews%20all%20of%20Gray's%20videos%2C%20but%20he%20said%20younger%20talent%20has%20a%20tougher%20time%20navigating%20the%20thicket%20of%20social%20media%20rules%20at%20top%20firms.%20Earlier%20this%20year%2C%20a%20group%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdemarre-johnson-finest-boys-finance-pwc-interview-magazine-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eself-identified%20finance%20bros%3C%2Fa%3E%20came%20under%20fire%20for%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffinance-boys-tiktok-generation-old-school-wall-street-goldman-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Enow-infamous%20photo%20shoot%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20raising%20the%20question%20of%20how%20Wall%20Street%20is%20handling%20the%20age%20of%20the%20influencer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20do%20think%20for%20young%20people%20it's%20harder%20because%20they%20grew%20up%20in%20a%20world%20where%20they%20post%20everything%2C%20and%20now%20they're%20working%20at%20a%20firm%20and%20there%20is%20a%20certain%20standard%2C%26quot%3B%20Gray%20said.%20Typically%2C%20he%20said%2C%20young%20employees%20at%20Blackstone%20regulate%20their%20content%20to%20align%20with%20the%20firm's%20image%20and%20values.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20he%20left%20the%20park%20around%208%20am%2C%20Gray%20had%20a%20big%20day%20ahead%20of%20him%2C%20since%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-blackstone-transformed-jersey-mikes-sharing-ipo-with-employees-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBlackstone%20was%20bringing%20Jersey%20Mike's%20%3C%2Fa%3Epublic%20in%20one%20of%20the%20biggest%20restaurant%20IPOs.%20He%20assured%20me%20the%20office%20would%20likely%20be%20full%20of%20ginormous%20subs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20post-cardio%20sandwich%20of%20choice%3F%20A%20turkey%20and%20provolone%2C%20%26quot%3BMike's%20way.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjon-gray-running-video-viral-blackstone-intern-analyst-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785663481000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6d1c6287737bff3ebda3b0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjon-gray-running-video-viral-blackstone-intern-analyst-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20spent%20my%20Thursday%20morning%20jogging%20with%20Jon%20Gray%20and%20Blackstone%20analysts%2C%20and%20felt%20firsthand%20the%20business%20value%20of%20his%20social%20media%20jogging%20videos.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22atecotzky%40businessinsider.com%20(Alice%20Tecotzky)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20%2425%2C000%20Slate%20truck%20is%20proudly%20bare-bones.%20I%20think%20these%20add-ons%20are%20worth%20the%20extra%20money.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223088%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Ben%20Shimkus%2C%20a%20reporter%20at%20Business%20Insider%2C%20stands%20in%20front%20of%20the%20base%20model%20Slate%20Truck.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6ca69197a2276a3423bc26%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20base%20model%20Slate%20has%20a%20lot%20of%20driving%20verve%20%E2%80%94%20but%20here's%20what%20I%20couldn't%20live%20without.%3Cp%3EBen%20Shimkus%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ESlate's%20main%20pitch%20is%20affordability.%20Its%20no-frills%20base%20model%20is%20just%20under%20%2425%2C000%20before%20charges.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIt's%20second%20core%20tenet%3A%20personalization.%20You%20can%20add%20hundreds%20of%20configurable%20options.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20drove%20the%20truck%20on%20Tuesday.%20Here's%20what%20I'd%20add%20to%20mine.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslate-ev-pickup-starting-price-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EThe%20Slate%20truck%3C%2Fa%3E%20doesn't%20have%20a%20typical%20key.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnlike%20today's%20cars%20%E2%80%94%20which%20pack%20proximity%20sensors%20inside%20a%20little%20plastic%20box%20that%20runs%20tech%20that%20allows%20drivers%20to%20start%20the%20engine%20via%20a%20push-start%20button%20%E2%80%94%20the%20Slate%20has%20a%20simple%20solution.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDrivers%20put%20a%20square%20key%20into%20a%20square%20slot.%20The%20instrument%20display%20flicks%20on.%20A%20single%20bell%20chimes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20it.%20There%20is%20no%20theatrical%20lighting%20sequence%2C%20symphony-like%20entrance%20music%2C%20or%20enormous%20touchscreen%20springing%20to%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20the%20windows%20are%20simpler.%20They're%20controlled%20by%20manual%20hand%20cranks.%20In%20my%20test%2C%20it%20took%20six%20or%20seven%20spins%20before%20the%20glass%20disappeared%20into%20the%20door%20panel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20deliberately%20plain%20interior%20captures%20Slate's%20entire%20pitch%3A%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fevs-touchscreen-buttons-coming-back-tesla-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EModern%20cars%20are%20too%20complicated%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20too%20expensive%2C%20and%20too%20eager%20to%20make%20every%20grocery%20trip%20feel%20like%20a%20Silicon%20Valley%20hype%20cycle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESlate's%20%2424%2C950%20electric%20truck%20(a%20little%20over%20%2426%2C000%2C%20after%20delivery%20fees)%20starts%20with%20the%20basics.%20Buyers%20can%20then%20use%20the%20company's%20accessory%20marketplace%20to%20add%20back%20the%20features%20they%20care%20about%2C%20including%20speakers%2C%20upgraded%20upholstery%2C%20colorful%20body%20wraps%2C%20storage%20accessories%2C%20and%20towing%20equipment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20is%20a%20very%20different%20way%20to%20make%20money%20after%20selling%20a%20car.%20While%20other%20automakers%20increasingly%20rely%20on%20software%20subscriptions%20and%20features%20delivered%20through%20updates%2C%20Slate%20wants%20customers%20to%20buy%20physical%20upgrades.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslate-truck-test-drive-electric-pickup-ev-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EI%20drove%20a%20prototype%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20Tuesday%20and%20came%20away%20pleasantly%20surprised.%20The%20inexpensive%20truck%20was%20roomy%2C%20balanced%2C%20and%20genuinely%20fun%20to%20drive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20the%20experience%20also%20showed%20me%20which%20modern%20conveniences%20I%20would%20miss.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20are%20the%20add-ons%20I'd%20buy%20to%20make%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslate-truck-affordability-comfort-tradeoff-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebare-bones%20Slate%20truck%20livable%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20plus%20the%20options%20I'd%20choose%20if%20money%20were%20no%20object.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ed945ff3-603a-4124-bb6a-6eb1a829aedd%5C%22%3EMy%20non-negotiables%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22874%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20gray%20Slate%20SUV%20with%20the%20squareback%20addition.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6cbcbb87737bff3ebd9eec%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221002%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20found%20five%20options%20on%20Slate's%20marketplace%20that%20I%20couldn't%20live%20without.%20That%20bumped%20the%20car's%20price%20well%20into%20the%20%2430%2C000%20range.%3Cp%3ESlate%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20found%20five%20add-ons%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslates-ev-truck-tiny-customizable-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESlate's%20marketplace%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20I'd%20need.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2237e9cbde-609c-4366-953c-144e1df6d5b7%5C%22%3EMore%20seats%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20base%20Slate%20is%20a%20two-seat%20pickup%2C%20which%20could%20be%20perfect%20for%20a%20small%20business%20hauling%20products%20around%20town.%20It%20would%20be%20considerably%20less%20useful%20for%20my%20life%2C%20unless%20I%20suddenly%20decided%20to%20stop%20driving%20my%20friends%20anywhere.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20my%20first%20upgrade%20would%20be%20Slate's%20squareback%20SUV%20kit.%20It%20adds%20a%20second-row%20bench%2C%20increases%20capacity%20from%20two%20people%20to%20five%2C%20and%20raises%20the%20price%20from%20%2424%2C950%20to%20%2429%2C950.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d0eff546-d7d8-4df8-9ff9-0d6d24ed162a%5C%22%3ESpeakers%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20friends%20would%20be%20mad%20if%20that%20car%20were%20silent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20spend%20too%20much%20time%20in%20cars%20listening%20to%20podcasts%20and%20Beyonc%C3%A9%20to%20rely%20on%20the%20natural%20symphonies%20of%20the%20roadway%2C%20so%20I%20would%20add%20Slate's%20%24250%20integrated%20speaker%20system.%20Buyers%20committed%20to%20the%20stripped-down%20lifestyle%20can%20instead%20choose%20a%20universal%20speaker%20mount%2C%20though%20Slate%20has%20not%20yet%20announced%20its%20price.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22395995d4-1bd1-4463-96b4-dcacbb9d4baa%5C%22%3EExtra%20locks%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EI%20would%20also%20spend%20%24100%20on%20a%20locking%20tailgate.%20Leaving%20the%20contents%20of%20the%20bed%20available%20to%20anyone%20walking%20past%20feels%20a%20little%20too%20bare-bones%2C%20even%20for%20Slate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ce660c6d-f1d7-404f-be6d-fdb564108cdc%5C%22%3EAccessories%20for%20a%20bike%20rack%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EFinally%2C%20I%20bike%20enough%20that%20I%20would%20need%20a%20rear-mounted%20carrier%20and%20a%20tow%20hitch%20to%20hold%20it.%20Together%2C%20those%20add%20another%20%24700.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20brings%20my%20supposedly%20bare-bones%20Slate%20to%20about%20%2431%2C000%20before%20taxes%20and%20destination%20fees.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20that%20price%2C%20it%20starts%20bumping%20into%20vehicles%20like%20the%20base%20Ford%20Maverick%20and%20Nissan%20Leaf%20%E2%80%94%20both%20of%20which%20arrive%20with%20power%20windows%2C%20infotainment%20screens%2C%20and%20fewer%20decisions%20to%20make%20before%20leaving%20the%20dealership.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227d8bd0b1-36bc-448e-a41d-982345dbeadc%5C%22%3EIf%20money%20didn't%20hold%20me%20back%E2%80%A6%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22On%20the%20left%3A%20the%20interior%20of%20a%20Slate%20truck%20with%20options.%20On%20the%20right%3A%20the%20exterior%20of%20a%20blue-wrapped%20slate%20truck%20with%20options.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6cdcad97a2276a3423bf01%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMy%20dream%20build%20would%20push%20nearly%20%2435%2C000.%3Cp%3ESlate%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOK%2C%20but%20what%20if%20I%20decided%20to%20splash%20out%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dream%20Slate%20would%20include%20a%20bevy%20of%20wildly%20unnecessary%20(but%20fun!)%20upgrades.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20would%20start%20with%20a%20blue%20body%20wrap%2C%20a%20white%20roof%2C%20matching%20wheel%20covers%2C%20and%20yellow%20accents.%20Who%20needs%20that%20%241%2C056%20anyway%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENaturally%2C%20the%20yellow%20would%20continue%20inside.%20And%20because%20I%20would%20also%20want%20to%20project%20outdoorsy%20ruggedness%2C%20I%20would%20add%20a%20rear-mounted%20spare%20tire%2C%20an%20upgraded%20bumper%2C%20fender%20flares%2C%20running%20boards%2C%20and%20a%20roof%20rack%20that%20I%20absolutely%20do%20not%20know%20how%20to%20use.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20adds%20another%20%242%2C374.94.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20the%20time%20I%20finished%2C%20my%20dream%20Slate%20had%2028%20accessories%2C%20including%20five%20that%20Slate%20has%20not%20priced%20yet.%20The%20running%20total%20reached%20%2434%2C949%20before%20those%20final%20bits%20and%20bobs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20excess%20is%20part%20of%20Slate's%20appeal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAutomakers%20have%20spent%20years%20filling%20parking%20lots%20with%20crossover%20SUVs%20that%20increasingly%20blur%20together.%20It%20can%20be%20difficult%20to%20distinguish%20a%20Toyota%20RAV4%20from%20a%20Honda%20CR-V%20or%20Mazda%20CX-5%20waiting%20in%20the%20school%20pickup%20line.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20era%20of%20the%20affordable%20personality%20car%20%E2%80%94%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvw-beetle-rise-fall-volkswagen-most-iconic-car-2019-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethink%20the%20Volkswagen%20Beetle%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20Chrysler%20PT%20Cruiser%20%E2%80%94%20has%20largely%20faded.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESlate%20gives%20buyers%20an%20unusual%20amount%20of%20freedom%20to%20make%20the%20truck%20look%20like%20their%20own%2C%20right%20down%20to%20a%20new%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcrayola-slate-truck-ev-color-wraps-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Epartnership%20with%20Crayola%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhether%20that%20is%20enough%20to%20create%20a%20mass-market%20hit%20remains%20to%20be%20seen.%20But%20after%20years%20of%20increasingly%20interchangeable%20cars%2C%20it%20is%20at%20least%20fun%20to%20build%20one%20with%20a%20little%20imagination.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslate-truck-customize-add-ons-best-recommendations-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785663061000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6ca69197a2276a3423bc26%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fslate-truck-customize-add-ons-best-recommendations-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Slat